(5026451, 732443, 75585, '<td valign="top">I have never seen anyone walk with their arms like that - usually they alternate opposite to their feet.  Interesting shot.  I really like the simplicity.</td>', 'I have never seen anyone walk with their arms like that - usually they alternate opposite to their feet.  Interesting shot.  I really like the simplicity.', '2008-10-27 01:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
