(5026682, 733381, 31889, '<td valign="top">Good spot!</td>', 'Good spot!', '2008-10-27 06:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026684, 733560, 99919, '<td valign="top">The brighter blues of this photograph give the building a bold and cold feeling, and seems to completely reject the persong sitting on the steps, although that person seems right at home. Despite the prominent colour, the blue gives a depressed feel so the whole photo makes one feel alone. Well named.</td>', 'The brighter blues of this photograph give the building a bold and cold feeling, and seems to completely reject the persong sitting on the steps, although that person seems right at home. Despite the prominent colour, the blue gives a depressed feel so the whole photo makes one feel alone. Well named.', '2008-10-27 06:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026685, 733508, 99919, '<td valign="top">This is such a darling photo...and although the black in the corner is too solild and seems to take over the photo, the photograph of the man himself is a stunning image.</td>', 'This is such a darling photo...and although the black in the corner is too solild and seems to take over the photo, the photograph of the man himself is a stunning image.', '2008-10-27 06:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026688, 733298, 99919, '<td valign="top">I like the bright and contrasting colours of this photo, but it does look a little too posed, but it shows the differences in nature and our own colour schemes which i like.</td>', 'I like the bright and contrasting colours of this photo, but it does look a little too posed, but it shows the differences in nature and our own colour schemes which i like.', '2008-10-27 06:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026691, 733907, 31889, '<td valign="top">Almost caught a wardrobe malfunction there.  Interesting image!</td>', 'Almost caught a wardrobe malfunction there.  Interesting image!', '2008-10-27 06:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026701, 733640, 53147, '<td valign="top">Not a macro but I think I recognize this one. ;)</td>', 'Not a macro but I think I recognize this one. ;)', '2008-10-27 07:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026706, 733604, 88523, '<td valign="top">Interesting setting. The train track, man with the umbrella and of course the tire service make a great combo.  I think would of like it even more you pushed the man more to the edge on the right and included more of the Tire service.</td>', 'Interesting setting. The train track, man with the umbrella and of course the tire service make a great combo.  I think would of like it even more you pushed the man more to the edge on the right and included more of the Tire service.', '2008-10-27 07:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026709, 733810, 88523, '<td valign="top">What a grand photo...The sun slicing through the high rises creating the long shadows on the little people going about there oblivious to what we are seeing really is something...</td>', 'What a grand photo...The sun slicing through the high rises creating the long shadows on the little people going about there oblivious to what we are seeing really is something...', '2008-10-27 07:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026713, 733424, 88523, '<td valign="top">Yay! Pigeons!Our co-citizens...nice that there aren''t any people in this pic just evidence of them.</td>', 'Yay! Pigeons!Our co-citizens...nice that there aren''t any people in this pic just evidence of them.', '2008-10-27 07:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026715, 733486, 88523, '<td valign="top">Cool backdrop and a very very well timed ''click''.</td>', 'Cool backdrop and a very very well timed ''click''.', '2008-10-27 07:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026717, 733871, 88523, '<td valign="top">Very strong find.... The shallow DOF works well here.</td>', 'Very strong find.... The shallow DOF works well here.', '2008-10-27 07:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026720, 733340, 88523, '<td valign="top">Very nice framing..this man really is staring right back at me...</td>', 'Very nice framing..this man really is staring right back at me...', '2008-10-27 07:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026722, 733515, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice catch! He''s staring at his shadow and the onlookers at him...cool...</td>', 'Nice catch! He''s staring at his shadow and the onlookers at him...cool...', '2008-10-27 07:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026723, 732443, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice placement and setting...</td>', 'Nice placement and setting...', '2008-10-27 07:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026724, 733515, 95579, '<td valign="top">Superb timing</td>', 'Superb timing', '2008-10-27 07:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026725, 733873, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice use of a fish eye... The design and colour are great.  And clever of you to catch people at opposite ends.</td>', 'Nice use of a fish eye... The design and colour are great.  And clever of you to catch people at opposite ends.', '2008-10-27 07:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026726, 733530, 88523, '<td valign="top">Ha! Good one. Nice framing, the child in the distance really adds to this.</td>', 'Ha! Good one. Nice framing, the child in the distance really adds to this.', '2008-10-27 07:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026731, 733617, 88523, '<td valign="top">The locals'' age and proximity to us let us know that they are staying and the tourist in the background is only temporary.</td>', 'The locals'' age and proximity to us let us know that they are staying and the tourist in the background is only temporary.', '2008-10-27 07:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026735, 733114, 88523, '<td valign="top">Good scene. The composition makes my eye explore the photo.</td>', 'Good scene. The composition makes my eye explore the photo.', '2008-10-27 07:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026736, 733373, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice and gritty...the tow zone provides a goo setting.</td>', 'Nice and gritty...the tow zone provides a goo setting.', '2008-10-27 07:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026738, 732507, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice one! Good use of fill flash.</td>', 'Nice one! Good use of fill flash.', '2008-10-27 07:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026739, 733265, 88523, '<td valign="top">Good use of the fish and well done for placing her in the middle distorting the passer-byers...</td>', 'Good use of the fish and well done for placing her in the middle distorting the passer-byers...', '2008-10-27 07:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026740, 732711, 88523, '<td valign="top">Good Candid and observation on the eye wear...You''ve brought right to us.</td>', 'Good Candid and observation on the eye wear...You''ve brought right to us.', '2008-10-27 07:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026741, 733824, 88523, '<td valign="top">Very cool composition.</td>', 'Very cool composition.', '2008-10-27 07:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026742, 733379, 88523, '<td valign="top">An African Grey! Nice scene, I wonder what her pic turned out like...</td>', 'An African Grey! Nice scene, I wonder what her pic turned out like...', '2008-10-27 07:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026743, 733661, 88523, '<td valign="top">Lovely street scene...</td>', 'Lovely street scene...', '2008-10-27 07:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026744, 733561, 88523, '<td valign="top">This rocks, we''re onlookers like the BMXer..</td>', 'This rocks, we''re onlookers like the BMXer..', '2008-10-27 07:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026758, 733388, 56002, '<td valign="top">I enjoyed viewing this.  Thanks.</td>', 'I enjoyed viewing this.  Thanks.', '2008-10-27 08:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026776, 733814, 92864, '<td valign="top">It looks underexposed.</td>', 'It looks underexposed.', '2008-10-27 08:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026788, 733753, 92864, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft...</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft...', '2008-10-27 08:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026795, 733465, 88523, '<td valign="top">Very ominous...</td>', 'Very ominous...', '2008-10-27 08:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026800, 733438, 88523, '<td valign="top">Your title illustrates spot on the feeling one gets  when looking at your photo.</td>', 'Your title illustrates spot on the feeling one gets  when looking at your photo.', '2008-10-27 08:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026802, 733617, 33352, '<td valign="top">I like this for its simplicity and clean lines...</td>', 'I like this for its simplicity and clean lines...', '2008-10-27 08:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026804, 733798, 33352, '<td valign="top">good perspective and selective color.</td>', 'good perspective and selective color.', '2008-10-27 08:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026808, 733873, 33352, '<td valign="top">This is almost 3d very nice result.</td>', 'This is almost 3d very nice result.', '2008-10-27 09:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026821, 733636, 88523, '<td valign="top">The boldness and of the letters makes for a great combination with the intensity the man is reading what he is...</td>', 'The boldness and of the letters makes for a great combination with the intensity the man is reading what he is...', '2008-10-27 09:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026822, 733547, 4493, '<td valign="top">While I think the subject matter is good, the blur I find a bit distracting, both the bike rider and the background OOF.</td>', 'While I think the subject matter is good, the blur I find a bit distracting, both the bike rider and the background OOF.', '2008-10-27 09:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026827, 733340, 4493, '<td valign="top">Your post processing detracts from an otherwise great subject. Perhaps a high contrast black and white treatment would have worked better with your subject.</td>', 'Your post processing detracts from an otherwise great subject. Perhaps a high contrast black and white treatment would have worked better with your subject.', '2008-10-27 09:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026830, 733761, 4493, '<td valign="top">Fine street scene, but no real main subject or idea conveyed. Also may be over exposed a half stop or more.</td>', 'Fine street scene, but no real main subject or idea conveyed. Also may be over exposed a half stop or more.', '2008-10-27 09:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026836, 733899, 4493, '<td valign="top">The placement of the people is fine, but overall the image doesn''t convey an overall theme/thought to relate the two people to both being in the shot. This may have actually been stronger with just the one person on the left and cropping out the whole right side.</td>', 'The placement of the people is fine, but overall the image doesn''t convey an overall theme/thought to relate the two people to both being in the shot. This may have actually been stronger with just the one person on the left and cropping out the whole right side.', '2008-10-27 09:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026839, 733886, 4493, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a square crop closer in on the subject and a black and white treatment would make your subject pop more.</td>', 'Perhaps a square crop closer in on the subject and a black and white treatment would make your subject pop more.', '2008-10-27 09:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026846, 733465, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very great compositional study. I''m surprised people didn''t stop walking when they saw you taking the pic. I''m trying to decide if a square crop with the reaper perfectly center might have been stronger with a light vignette to keep the eye from wandering to the edges of the scene. Overall I really like this image.</td>', 'Very great compositional study. I''m surprised people didn''t stop walking when they saw you taking the pic. I''m trying to decide if a square crop with the reaper perfectly center might have been stronger with a light vignette to keep the eye from wandering to the edges of the scene. Overall I really like this image.', '2008-10-27 09:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026848, 733790, 4493, '<td valign="top">Technically it''s a street, and a photograph, but it''s not street photography.</td>', 'Technically it''s a street, and a photograph, but it''s not street photography.', '2008-10-27 09:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026852, 733918, 4493, '<td valign="top">The bag is a bummer, but uncontrollable by you. I like the saturation of colors and framing of the shot.</td>', 'The bag is a bummer, but uncontrollable by you. I like the saturation of colors and framing of the shot.', '2008-10-27 09:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026855, 733813, 4493, '<td valign="top">Crop on the right is a bit tight. Otherwise the image hold my attention well with the use of shapes and angles.</td>', 'Crop on the right is a bit tight. Otherwise the image hold my attention well with the use of shapes and angles.', '2008-10-27 09:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026857, 733794, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like how the person in white clothing stands out in the scene. He may be just a bit overexposed for the scene. The Obama sign leaning in countered by the tree on the right frame the shot nicely. Good image.</td>', 'I like how the person in white clothing stands out in the scene. He may be just a bit overexposed for the scene. The Obama sign leaning in countered by the tree on the right frame the shot nicely. Good image.', '2008-10-27 09:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026861, 733528, 4493, '<td valign="top">The blur on the left is distracting. I don''t feel there''s a central subject to this shot other than a broken fountain, which to me, doesn''t satisfy my notion of what street photography is.</td>', 'The blur on the left is distracting. I don''t feel there''s a central subject to this shot other than a broken fountain, which to me, doesn''t satisfy my notion of what street photography is.', '2008-10-27 09:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026864, 733787, 4493, '<td valign="top">Funny how it looks like the duck is posing his ''good side''. The image is underexposed though.</td>', 'Funny how it looks like the duck is posing his ''good side''. The image is underexposed though.', '2008-10-27 09:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026865, 733280, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good for you to go out and interact with the ''street''. A slight crop of the left might make this a little stronger. I like your subject''s smile and interaction.</td>', 'Good for you to go out and interact with the ''street''. A slight crop of the left might make this a little stronger. I like your subject''s smile and interaction.', '2008-10-27 09:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026868, 733424, 4493, '<td valign="top">The focus of the flying bird distracts from the scene. I also have a hard time fitting this into what my idea of what street photography is. This shot seems random, not thought out or composed.</td>', 'The focus of the flying bird distracts from the scene. I also have a hard time fitting this into what my idea of what street photography is. This shot seems random, not thought out or composed.', '2008-10-27 09:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026869, 732646, 4493, '<td valign="top">The post processing to bring up the shadows is slightly distracting from an otherwise interesting image. Exposure should have been set for the man in the chair so that everyone under the tent would be exposed correctly. It wouldn''t have mattered that the background would have been totally overexposed. Overall, good shot.</td>', 'The post processing to bring up the shadows is slightly distracting from an otherwise interesting image. Exposure should have been set for the man in the chair so that everyone under the tent would be exposed correctly. It wouldn''t have mattered that the background would have been totally overexposed. Overall, good shot.', '2008-10-27 09:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026872, 733381, 54228, '<td valign="top">Just came back to bump this one up, my one and only 10 for the challenge. This tells a great story, it is representative of all that, IMHO, street photography should be. I hope to see it on the front page.</td>', 'Just came back to bump this one up, my one and only 10 for the challenge. This tells a great story, it is representative of all that, IMHO, street photography should be. I hope to see it on the front page.', '2008-10-27 09:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026876, 733909, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not really sure on the postprocessing of this and how it helps the image. The people on the left, I assume are your subject, but they are so far away and near the edge of the shot that the bus and white car opposite keep your eye from even finding them. Overall this image lacks a central subject and has too much going on.</td>', 'Not really sure on the postprocessing of this and how it helps the image. The people on the left, I assume are your subject, but they are so far away and near the edge of the shot that the bus and white car opposite keep your eye from even finding them. Overall this image lacks a central subject and has too much going on.', '2008-10-27 09:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026877, 733330, 54228, '<td valign="top">I really like the blurring on this, it adds so much to the image. This is life in an image, well captured.</td>', 'I really like the blurring on this, it adds so much to the image. This is life in an image, well captured.', '2008-10-27 09:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026878, 733149, 54228, '<td valign="top">I like all that this represents, the dead tree, the harsh lines of the city, and the woman moving on to something better. Excellent capture.</td>', 'I like all that this represents, the dead tree, the harsh lines of the city, and the woman moving on to something better. Excellent capture.', '2008-10-27 09:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5026879, 732647, 4493, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate that you probably are a fan of this post processing, but I think that your treatment competes with your subject. I think just a well done standard b/w treatment with a slight vignette would make the guy and his art behind him the main subject instead of the post processing being the main subject.</td>', 'I can appreciate that you probably are a fan of this post processing, but I think that your treatment competes with your subject. I think just a well done standard b/w treatment with a slight vignette would make the guy and his art behind him the main subject instead of the post processing being the main subject.', '2008-10-27 09:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
