(5027299, 733739, 4493, '<td valign="top">The subject being cut in half on the left of the frame distracts me from what she''s taking a picture of. I feel if she was 3/4 or more into the frame it''d make for a strong picture.</td>', 'The subject being cut in half on the left of the frame distracts me from what she''s taking a picture of. I feel if she was 3/4 or more into the frame it''d make for a strong picture.', '2008-10-27 13:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
