(5027314, 733910, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like that the guy in the cap looking at the camera. It adds interest to the shot. A b/w treatment may even make this a stronger shot by removing the distractions of color throughout the image.</td>', 'I like that the guy in the cap looking at the camera. It adds interest to the shot. A b/w treatment may even make this a stronger shot by removing the distractions of color throughout the image.', '2008-10-27 13:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027316, 733515, 4493, '<td valign="top">not sure what I''m seeing here, but I do feel a more square crop removing most the right side past the spectators would keep my eye on the girl and not wandering out of frame.</td>', 'not sure what I''m seeing here, but I do feel a more square crop removing most the right side past the spectators would keep my eye on the girl and not wandering out of frame.', '2008-10-27 13:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027323, 733898, 4493, '<td valign="top">What is it you found compelling in this image? I look at it and see a snapshot while you walked down the road. Only story here I can see is someone''s having a kegger and you happened to be there when they loaded the truck. Composition is flat and uninspired. Post processing doesn''t add to the shot. The subject doesn''t engage the viewer.</td>', 'What is it you found compelling in this image? I look at it and see a snapshot while you walked down the road. Only story here I can see is someone''s having a kegger and you happened to be there when they loaded the truck. Composition is flat and uninspired. Post processing doesn''t add to the shot. The subject doesn''t engage the viewer.', '2008-10-27 13:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027324, 733617, 4493, '<td valign="top">Image is ok. I would like it framed with more space on the local side, and less on the tourist side.</td>', 'Image is ok. I would like it framed with more space on the local side, and less on the tourist side.', '2008-10-27 13:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027341, 733317, 4493, '<td valign="top">The post processing is a little heavy I think, but the composition is compelling. I think a slightly slower shutter speed so as to have captured some more movement in the drum stick would make this a great shot.</td>', 'The post processing is a little heavy I think, but the composition is compelling. I think a slightly slower shutter speed so as to have captured some more movement in the drum stick would make this a great shot.', '2008-10-27 13:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027344, 733566, 4493, '<td valign="top">Snuck a photo at the mall? I think if one of the subjects had looked back when you captured the shot, it''d bring the viewer more into the shot. I do like the mural on the back wall and how it ties the fashion to the foreground. That being said, I think keeping this shot in color would have been stronger. Fashion is about colors and textures and by removing the color, you''ve eliminated some of the subject you''re trying to convey.</td>', 'Snuck a photo at the mall? I think if one of the subjects had looked back when you captured the shot, it''d bring the viewer more into the shot. I do like the mural on the back wall and how it ties the fashion to the foreground. That being said, I think keeping this shot in color would have been stronger. Fashion is about colors and textures and by removing the color, you''ve eliminated some of the subject you''re trying to convey.', '2008-10-27 13:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027355, 733571, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but this shot seems staged. It may not be, but the overall feel of the image is so so. I think the biggest distraction is the truck behind them. I know that you''re using the curved line of the benches, but with the truck there, my eye doesn''t follow the curve, it b-lines right to the truck. Experiment with other angles if you have something of that size in the background of the shot.</td>', 'I''m sorry but this shot seems staged. It may not be, but the overall feel of the image is so so. I think the biggest distraction is the truck behind them. I know that you''re using the curved line of the benches, but with the truck there, my eye doesn''t follow the curve, it b-lines right to the truck. Experiment with other angles if you have something of that size in the background of the shot.', '2008-10-27 13:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027362, 732443, 4493, '<td valign="top">Anthropologie is a retailer of high-end casual clothing and other merchandise run by Urban Outfitters, Inc. A somewhat new apparel retailer, Anthropologie has used unique marketing and branding techniques to become a forerunner in womens fashion.[1]<br/> <br/>Seeing the subject in black and white as they walk out of the frame doesn''t give me a feeling for what the subject is suppose to be. Her arms seem awkward in this shot. She doesn''t engage the viewer enough to overpower the sign above her head, plus with her walking out of the frame, my eye goes right out the frame with her and don''t return.</td>', 'Anthropologie is a retailer of high-end casual clothing and other merchandise run by Urban Outfitters, Inc. A somewhat new apparel retailer, Anthropologie has used unique marketing and branding techniques to become a forerunner in womens fashion.[1] Seeing the subject in black and white as they walk out of the frame doesn''t give me a feeling for what the subject is suppose to be. Her arms seem awkward in this shot. She doesn''t engage the viewer enough to overpower the sign above her head, plus with her walking out of the frame, my eye goes right out the frame with her and don''t return.', '2008-10-27 14:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027369, 733077, 4493, '<td valign="top">The sun is too high in the sky to give this a warm and inviting feel. The signs behind the tables distract me and keep me from wanting to sit for a cup of coffee. This feels like you were walking past and just snapped the picture. With all the elements in this shot were there no interesting angles you could have tried to make the shot pull in the viewer and make the whole scene more inviting?</td>', 'The sun is too high in the sky to give this a warm and inviting feel. The signs behind the tables distract me and keep me from wanting to sit for a cup of coffee. This feels like you were walking past and just snapped the picture. With all the elements in this shot were there no interesting angles you could have tried to make the shot pull in the viewer and make the whole scene more inviting?', '2008-10-27 14:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027374, 733915, 4493, '<td valign="top">He doesn''t look relaxed to me, and he looks like you''ve asked him to sit there why you take his pic and he doesn''t want to be there. Your grey scale treatment is flat, and overall angle and composition is lack luster. Try different angles, read up on b/w conversions.</td>', 'He doesn''t look relaxed to me, and he looks like you''ve asked him to sit there why you take his pic and he doesn''t want to be there. Your grey scale treatment is flat, and overall angle and composition is lack luster. Try different angles, read up on b/w conversions.', '2008-10-27 14:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027376, 733756, 4493, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I feel I''ve seen this before. Unlike the other angle of this shot, I like that you''ve included more of the shooter in the image. I also like that it''s in landscape mode. The b/w treatment is just a bit on the dark side, but overall a good image.</td>', 'Hmmm, I feel I''ve seen this before. Unlike the other angle of this shot, I like that you''ve included more of the shooter in the image. I also like that it''s in landscape mode. The b/w treatment is just a bit on the dark side, but overall a good image.', '2008-10-27 14:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027379, 733317, 85451, '<td valign="top">Good pic, I like the feel of it. However my eye keeps getting drawn to the big yellow and red circle just above the drummer. I assume it''s a street sign/light of some sort. I would have liked to see that toned down (since it is advanced editing)</td>', 'Good pic, I like the feel of it. However my eye keeps getting drawn to the big yellow and red circle just above the drummer. I assume it''s a street sign/light of some sort. I would have liked to see that toned down (since it is advanced editing)', '2008-10-27 14:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027380, 733112, 4493, '<td valign="top">Another of a long list of pictures where I feel the photographer was just walking down the street snapping random photos. Your post processing has oversharpened the image. One thing that could help is if you''d crop this as a square and frame her in the center of the shot. As it is now, the stuff on the left of the shot pulls the eye away from the person walking in front of the door.</td>', 'Another of a long list of pictures where I feel the photographer was just walking down the street snapping random photos. Your post processing has oversharpened the image. One thing that could help is if you''d crop this as a square and frame her in the center of the shot. As it is now, the stuff on the left of the shot pulls the eye away from the person walking in front of the door.', '2008-10-27 14:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027387, 733444, 85451, '<td valign="top">Is this a common occurence where you live? Very neat picture, love the action.</td>', 'Is this a common occurence where you live? Very neat picture, love the action.', '2008-10-27 14:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027396, 733524, 63398, '<td valign="top">I love the selective desat &amp; the composition. 8</td>', 'I love the selective desat & the composition. 8', '2008-10-27 14:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027397, 733810, 63398, '<td valign="top">I love the brilliant sun, the long shadows, and the thought provoking title. Nicely done-8</td>', 'I love the brilliant sun, the long shadows, and the thought provoking title. Nicely done-8', '2008-10-27 14:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027398, 733644, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!!! Even more so if you just happened on this. 8</td>', 'This is awesome!!! Even more so if you just happened on this. 8', '2008-10-27 14:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027400, 733402, 63398, '<td valign="top">Great capture, perfect processing, poignant and insightful. 8</td>', 'Great capture, perfect processing, poignant and insightful. 8', '2008-10-27 14:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027406, 733438, 63398, '<td valign="top">A stunning image! Sheer beauty, the allure of a stolen capture, and the window &amp; grain make the shot with the texture. 8</td>', 'A stunning image! Sheer beauty, the allure of a stolen capture, and the window & grain make the shot with the texture. 8', '2008-10-27 14:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027408, 733340, 63398, '<td valign="top">Exquisite detail, and I love the lighting/tonal range. What a terrific, expressive countenance. 8</td>', 'Exquisite detail, and I love the lighting/tonal range. What a terrific, expressive countenance. 8', '2008-10-27 14:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027409, 733280, 63398, '<td valign="top">Fantastic slice of street life. 8</td>', 'Fantastic slice of street life. 8', '2008-10-27 14:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027414, 733363, 63398, '<td valign="top">Heart wrenching...terrific composition. The kitten is an exceptional touch. I gacve you an extra point for the kitty.</td>', 'Heart wrenching...terrific composition. The kitten is an exceptional touch. I gacve you an extra point for the kitty.', '2008-10-27 14:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027417, 733784, 63398, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, tonal range, vignette......great image, IMO. 8</td>', 'I like the angle, tonal range, vignette......great image, IMO. 8', '2008-10-27 14:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027420, 733380, 63398, '<td valign="top">What a great capture! Very warming. The B&amp;W is absolutely the right choice IMO. 8</td>', 'What a great capture! Very warming. The B&W is absolutely the right choice IMO. 8', '2008-10-27 14:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027422, 733385, 85451, '<td valign="top">''dude, do you think... do you think... we could like... eat that dog?''<br/> <br/>''man, we totally could!''<br/> <br/>''heheheheheheh''</td>', '''dude, do you think... do you think... we could like... eat that dog?'' ''man, we totally could!'' ''heheheheheheh''', '2008-10-27 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027424, 733379, 63398, '<td valign="top">This is just right on so many counts! Greys are wonderful birds! How nice of him to mug for you! Best of luck on a truly wonderful scene. (Extra bonus for the Nikon! LOL) 8</td>', 'This is just right on so many counts! Greys are wonderful birds! How nice of him to mug for you! Best of luck on a truly wonderful scene. (Extra bonus for the Nikon! LOL) 8', '2008-10-27 14:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
