(5027449, 733795, 85451, '<td valign="top">de facto phone? standard phone? cute girl, i''m going to be a bit nitpicky and say that I don''t like the shadow on her arm or the bike by her hand, but your not losing points for it =)</td>', 'de facto phone? standard phone? cute girl, i''m going to be a bit nitpicky and say that I don''t like the shadow on her arm or the bike by her hand, but your not losing points for it =)', '2008-10-27 14:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
