(5027704, 733381, 49804, '<td valign="top">Wow, very nicely done, very emotive, love the comparison going on here, also the dog adds a ton to the shot for me, everyone seems so happy there on the left, and it looks like the guy on the right is trying to scrounge together the money. You nailed the essence of "street photography" to me here. 9 from me.</td>', 'Wow, very nicely done, very emotive, love the comparison going on here, also the dog adds a ton to the shot for me, everyone seems so happy there on the left, and it looks like the guy on the right is trying to scrounge together the money. You nailed the essence of "street photography" to me here. 9 from me.', '2008-10-27 16:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027705, 733421, 55956, '<td valign="top">well the background is intresting, the couple of silhouette work here. well done.</td>', 'well the background is intresting, the couple of silhouette work here. well done.', '2008-10-27 16:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027720, 733714, 55956, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if your crop cut something that disturb the image but really I don''t understand why that frame. it adjust the composition because add a lot of space around the subject but for me you don''t need of it(or probably the image was in "landscape" format and you had space). a good image.</td>', 'I don''t know if your crop cut something that disturb the image but really I don''t understand why that frame. it adjust the composition because add a lot of space around the subject but for me you don''t need of it(or probably the image was in "landscape" format and you had space). a good image.', '2008-10-27 17:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027729, 733910, 86322, '<td valign="top">Looks very natural, I like the way you capture the guy with the cards to be the one in focus.</td>', 'Looks very natural, I like the way you capture the guy with the cards to be the one in focus.', '2008-10-27 17:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027732, 733465, 55956, '<td valign="top">a surreal image, probably not a candid portrait but a very good image. In the motion blur challenge should be a killer image!</td>', 'a surreal image, probably not a candid portrait but a very good image. In the motion blur challenge should be a killer image!', '2008-10-27 17:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5027734, 733463, 45475, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. Has wonderful elements... romance, a great view, birds in flight... It suffers a bit from editing flaws like sharpening halos and slight pixel distortion though, but nonetheless lovely :)</td>', 'Lovely shot. Has wonderful elements... romance, a great view, birds in flight... It suffers a bit from editing flaws like sharpening halos and slight pixel distortion though, but nonetheless lovely :)', '2008-10-27 17:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
