(5028135, 733140, 85451, '<td valign="top">That kid must be a crazy republican! =)<br/> <br/>It''s an interesting shot, I do like all the action that going on. I was about to post a comment about how this wasn''t street photography, but then I decided to educate myself first and thank god I did! One small nitpick, I think I would have tried to clone out/crop out the lady on the phone to the right. My eye keeps getting drawn over to her.</td>', 'That kid must be a crazy republican! =) It''s an interesting shot, I do like all the action that going on. I was about to post a comment about how this wasn''t street photography, but then I decided to educate myself first and thank god I did! One small nitpick, I think I would have tried to clone out/crop out the lady on the phone to the right. My eye keeps getting drawn over to her.', '2008-10-27 20:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
