(5028238, 733486, 75713, '<td valign="top">coming back to comment only:<br/> <br/>already voted - and gave this shot a high one.. what really stands out for me is the clarity in this shot.. wonderful pping.. the lighting is great - the action was captured perfectly.. both feet off the ground.. love how how the painted figure on the right seems to be staring at the child making the shot ..and the painted figure on the left is looking the the child trying to block it.. just so well photographed!</td>', 'coming back to comment only: already voted - and gave this shot a high one.. what really stands out for me is the clarity in this shot.. wonderful pping.. the lighting is great - the action was captured perfectly.. both feet off the ground.. love how how the painted figure on the right seems to be staring at the child making the shot ..and the painted figure on the left is looking the the child trying to block it.. just so well photographed!', '2008-10-27 22:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
