(5028261, 733524, 68947, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Lovely capture.  Made me stop to really look.  I''ve seen this done quite a bit in SP  Still, nicely done</td>', 'Nicely done.  Lovely capture.  Made me stop to really look.  I''ve seen this done quite a bit in SP  Still, nicely done', '2008-10-27 22:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028270, 733636, 68947, '<td valign="top">I really had to look at this to see if it was really different editing or, what was really in this shot!  VERY INTERESTING SHOT!  It''s not until you really look that you figure out that it''s a sign above bistro tables and chairs!  Now if only someone had have sat down there or you had have shown more of the table and chair???  I really like it!  The more I look at it, the more I like it!  :)</td>', 'I really had to look at this to see if it was really different editing or, what was really in this shot!  VERY INTERESTING SHOT!  It''s not until you really look that you figure out that it''s a sign above bistro tables and chairs!  Now if only someone had have sat down there or you had have shown more of the table and chair???  I really like it!  The more I look at it, the more I like it!  :)', '2008-10-27 22:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028272, 733402, 68947, '<td valign="top">I love the concept..love the little boy looking back and the fact that to emphasize the two and the glance, you have coloured the two but, b&amp;w for the rest.  However, it seems a bit TOO obvious to me.  I think that viewers might have caught it had you left it either in color or in B&amp;W.  Still, it''s a great capture!</td>', 'I love the concept..love the little boy looking back and the fact that to emphasize the two and the glance, you have coloured the two but, b&w for the rest.  However, it seems a bit TOO obvious to me.  I think that viewers might have caught it had you left it either in color or in B&W.  Still, it''s a great capture!', '2008-10-27 22:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028276, 732711, 68947, '<td valign="top">The guy looks a bit like Jack Nicholson! LOL  I think that the border kind of detracts and you are likely taking flack for it, right?  My bet is that you''re fairly new to DPC, right?  I had to learn that lesson the hard way too! LOL  I learned all too quickly about the framing and borders.  It''s fun but, DPCers don''t tend to like them very much and will down scores because of it.  I''m not!  I am judging the photo for the photo. :)</td>', 'The guy looks a bit like Jack Nicholson! LOL  I think that the border kind of detracts and you are likely taking flack for it, right?  My bet is that you''re fairly new to DPC, right?  I had to learn that lesson the hard way too! LOL  I learned all too quickly about the framing and borders.  It''s fun but, DPCers don''t tend to like them very much and will down scores because of it.  I''m not!  I am judging the photo for the photo. :)', '2008-10-27 23:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028277, 733704, 68947, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones to this shot as well as the elements!  7</td>', 'I really like the tones to this shot as well as the elements!  7', '2008-10-27 23:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
