(5028423, 733636, 16046, '<td valign="top">Great B/W treatment really enhances this image, bravo</td>', 'Great B/W treatment really enhances this image, bravo', '2008-10-28 01:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028426, 733801, 16046, '<td valign="top">Well done, great light</td>', 'Well done, great light', '2008-10-28 01:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028490, 733381, 99263, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot. I see it''s taken in Italy somewhere. It reminds me of a modern day version of the scenes one often sees depicted in the wall murals and paintings of Classical Rome. Images of lavish feasts with plenty of wine flowing and trays groaning under the weight of all the food. And somewhere in those images there''s always the figure of some pauper or poor man to show the contrasts and contradictions of life. This is what this image evokes in me.<br/>From a technical point of view I find the lighting and tones superb.<br/>So many different things happening in this scene. All the elements are in the right place. The guy sitting outside of the luxury zone counting his pennies perhaps wishing that he could join the extravagant people on the terrace for a drink or something to eat. That white dog being patted also adds something special to the composition and is also a recurring image in the classical wall murals and paintings right down to it''s particular pose.<br/>Well done, lovely composition. A winner for me and I say that even though I have an entry in this challenge as well.<br/>I give you full score 10. This is the only 10 I gave in this challenge by the way.</td>', 'Wonderful shot. I see it''s taken in Italy somewhere. It reminds me of a modern day version of the scenes one often sees depicted in the wall murals and paintings of Classical Rome. Images of lavish feasts with plenty of wine flowing and trays groaning under the weight of all the food. And somewhere in those images there''s always the figure of some pauper or poor man to show the contrasts and contradictions of life. This is what this image evokes in me.From a technical point of view I find the lighting and tones superb.So many different things happening in this scene. All the elements are in the right place. The guy sitting outside of the luxury zone counting his pennies perhaps wishing that he could join the extravagant people on the terrace for a drink or something to eat. That white dog being patted also adds something special to the composition and is also a recurring image in the classical wall murals and paintings right down to it''s particular pose.Well done, lovely composition. A winner for me and I say that even though I have an entry in this challenge as well.I give you full score 10. This is the only 10 I gave in this challenge by the way.', '2008-10-28 03:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028491, 733385, 99263, '<td valign="top">Exquisite moment you captured here. The 2 doped up punks laughing at the dog and the dog seemingly laughing at the absurdity of it all. I really like this shot.<br/>I give this a 9</td>', 'Exquisite moment you captured here. The 2 doped up punks laughing at the dog and the dog seemingly laughing at the absurdity of it all. I really like this shot.I give this a 9', '2008-10-28 03:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028492, 733794, 99263, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition with all the elements in place to give significance to the question mark at the end of your chosen title.<br/>I gave an 8 for this.</td>', 'Excellent composition with all the elements in place to give significance to the question mark at the end of your chosen title.I gave an 8 for this.', '2008-10-28 03:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028493, 733421, 99263, '<td valign="top">Great shot with lots of impact. Nice tones and I like the two people in the foreground silhouetted against the photo''s they are looking at.<br/>I gave a 7</td>', 'Great shot with lots of impact. Nice tones and I like the two people in the foreground silhouetted against the photo''s they are looking at.I gave a 7', '2008-10-28 03:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028494, 733351, 99263, '<td valign="top">Sublime shot. I love it.<br/>I gave a 7</td>', 'Sublime shot. I love it.I gave a 7', '2008-10-28 03:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028495, 733705, 99263, '<td valign="top">Great capture, exquisite moment and I like the processing.<br/>I gave a 7</td>', 'Great capture, exquisite moment and I like the processing.I gave a 7', '2008-10-28 03:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028497, 733438, 99263, '<td valign="top">This is quite special. I like the way you caught her, shooting from behind the glass and how unaware she is of the moment being captured. The graininess and the rivulets of water running down the window pane add to the overall impact. I get the idea it''s just started raining and she was caught unprepared without an umbrella and not dressed for the rain.<br/>I gave a 7</td>', 'This is quite special. I like the way you caught her, shooting from behind the glass and how unaware she is of the moment being captured. The graininess and the rivulets of water running down the window pane add to the overall impact. I get the idea it''s just started raining and she was caught unprepared without an umbrella and not dressed for the rain.I gave a 7', '2008-10-28 03:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028498, 733373, 99263, '<td valign="top">This is great. I love the setting,the raw colors,the grain and the processing.<br/>I gave a 7</td>', 'This is great. I love the setting,the raw colors,the grain and the processing.I gave a 7', '2008-10-28 03:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028500, 733873, 99263, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. Unusual and well illustrated view of the city jungle.<br/>I gave a 7</td>', 'I like this very much. Unusual and well illustrated view of the city jungle.I gave a 7', '2008-10-28 03:59:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028504, 733402, 99263, '<td valign="top">Great capture that stirs the emotions. I would have preferred the entire shot in black and white though. It''s almost as if you are trying to force the viewer to see the relevance of the title by having the man and the child in color and I find it  detracts from the overall impact of this otherwise fantastic composition.<br/>I gave a 7 but had it been in black and white only would have given a 8</td>', 'Great capture that stirs the emotions. I would have preferred the entire shot in black and white though. It''s almost as if you are trying to force the viewer to see the relevance of the title by having the man and the child in color and I find it  detracts from the overall impact of this otherwise fantastic composition.I gave a 7 but had it been in black and white only would have given a 8', '2008-10-28 04:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028506, 733695, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. The pastel colors and lighting are very nice. The silhouette of the figure disappearing at the far end adds a flavor of mystery.<br/>I gave a 7</td>', 'Lovely composition. The pastel colors and lighting are very nice. The silhouette of the figure disappearing at the far end adds a flavor of mystery.I gave a 7', '2008-10-28 04:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028578, 733265, 94239, '<td valign="top">This lens is effective here, it gives movement to the scene. Like a moment on the carousel of life. Nice subtle tones, and lots of interesting things to look at.</td>', 'This lens is effective here, it gives movement to the scene. Like a moment on the carousel of life. Nice subtle tones, and lots of interesting things to look at.', '2008-10-28 07:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028580, 733298, 95579, '<td valign="top">great colours, really contrast well with her expression of disinterest - 9</td>', 'great colours, really contrast well with her expression of disinterest - 9', '2008-10-28 07:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028581, 733438, 94239, '<td valign="top">I love this. The grain, the rain, the square crop, the b&amp;w and the expression captured all make this beautiful and interesting.</td>', 'I love this. The grain, the rain, the square crop, the b&w and the expression captured all make this beautiful and interesting.', '2008-10-28 07:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028582, 733438, 95579, '<td valign="top">Really like the grainyness and the streaks on the window - 9</td>', 'Really like the grainyness and the streaks on the window - 9', '2008-10-28 07:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028583, 733381, 95579, '<td valign="top">Love the 2 distinct bubbles of way of life, nice balance to the composition as well - 9</td>', 'Love the 2 distinct bubbles of way of life, nice balance to the composition as well - 9', '2008-10-28 07:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028585, 733642, 95579, '<td valign="top">Really like the distinctions, great capture - 9</td>', 'Really like the distinctions, great capture - 9', '2008-10-28 07:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
