(5028596, 733705, 95579, '<td valign="top">Wow, they like themselves a lot. But they do make a great photo! - 8</td>', 'Wow, they like themselves a lot. But they do make a great photo! - 8', '2008-10-28 07:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
