(5028601, 733388, 95579, '<td valign="top">I like all the elements in this image.  Beyond that I cant explain why I like it (sorry im not that expressive!!), but I really do : ) - 8</td>', 'I like all the elements in this image.  Beyond that I cant explain why I like it (sorry im not that expressive!!), but I really do : ) - 8', '2008-10-28 07:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
