(5028604, 733896, 94239, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and lines and soft colours.  Great composition. You have made it look very inviting, wherever he is.</td>', 'Lovely light and lines and soft colours.  Great composition. You have made it look very inviting, wherever he is.', '2008-10-28 07:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
