(5028914, 733767, 39057, '<td valign="top">I''ll make it a point to shop there.</td>', 'I''ll make it a point to shop there.', '2008-10-28 11:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028932, 733636, 40718, '<td valign="top">Well, this is the very first shot I see and I''m afaid it''s all going to be downhill from here.  A fairly modern processing touch on a classic genre, but I think it works. 9</td>', 'Well, this is the very first shot I see and I''m afaid it''s all going to be downhill from here.  A fairly modern processing touch on a classic genre, but I think it works. 9', '2008-10-28 11:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5028939, 733381, 40718, '<td valign="top">You know, this challenge is full of a ton of pictures of people just thinking they can snap anything on the street, convert to B&amp;W and enter it.  Only a few try to tell a story.  This is absolutely one of them.  I thought I had seen the winner already, but I changed my mind.  Auto 10 and a fav.</td>', 'You know, this challenge is full of a ton of pictures of people just thinking they can snap anything on the street, convert to B&W and enter it.  Only a few try to tell a story.  This is absolutely one of them.  I thought I had seen the winner already, but I changed my mind.  Auto 10 and a fav.', '2008-10-28 11:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029044, 733438, 41116, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The B&amp;W works well as well as the grain/noisy feel of the image, and the soft focus.</td>', 'I really like this. The B&W works well as well as the grain/noisy feel of the image, and the soft focus.', '2008-10-28 12:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029084, 733486, 75720, '<td valign="top">Amazing! love it.<br/>I can tell that it''ll be 1st or 2nd</td>', 'Amazing! love it.I can tell that it''ll be 1st or 2nd', '2008-10-28 13:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029136, 733265, 69668, '<td valign="top">This should be the blue ribbon in my opinion.  Tells a great story, love the distortion used to emphasize the woman.  The title adds to the image, overall a very emotional and telling photograph.  10</td>', 'This should be the blue ribbon in my opinion.  Tells a great story, love the distortion used to emphasize the woman.  The title adds to the image, overall a very emotional and telling photograph.  10', '2008-10-28 13:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029138, 733363, 69668, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks for this chalenge.  The kitten adds an emotional appeal to the photograph.  The clothing tells a story, so does the gentleman''s hair, and I like that you kept the image in color.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'One of my top picks for this chalenge.  The kitten adds an emotional appeal to the photograph.  The clothing tells a story, so does the gentleman''s hair, and I like that you kept the image in color.  Very nicely done.', '2008-10-28 13:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029139, 733381, 69668, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks for this challenge.  Great compositon, and a very strong story/message with this photograph.</td>', 'One of my top picks for this challenge.  Great compositon, and a very strong story/message with this photograph.', '2008-10-28 13:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029141, 733486, 69668, '<td valign="top">Great composition and background here.  A favorite of mine in this challenge.</td>', 'Great composition and background here.  A favorite of mine in this challenge.', '2008-10-28 13:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029144, 733801, 69668, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  I love the setting, the angle, and the spray.  I am voting on this as it was not a set-up image that you took.  It takes away form the story if this was a set up image.  However, it is one of my favorites in the challenge.  Great street image with alot of character to it.</td>', 'Very well done.  I love the setting, the angle, and the spray.  I am voting on this as it was not a set-up image that you took.  It takes away form the story if this was a set up image.  However, it is one of my favorites in the challenge.  Great street image with alot of character to it.', '2008-10-28 13:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029148, 733561, 69668, '<td valign="top">In enjoy this image and the post processing of it.  It looks like a lensbaby was used?  Well done.</td>', 'In enjoy this image and the post processing of it.  It looks like a lensbaby was used?  Well done.', '2008-10-28 13:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029183, 732647, 99396, '<td valign="top">good processing</td>', 'good processing', '2008-10-28 14:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029203, 733794, 30791, '<td valign="top">great piece of photojournalism! awesome! 10</td>', 'great piece of photojournalism! awesome! 10', '2008-10-28 14:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029254, 733465, 30982, '<td valign="top">I rather like this.  Has sort of a ready made story going for it, but in addition to that, I like the motion blur against the crispness of the background.  The crossing adds a nice strong graphical element to it.  An alternate title might be "Time Stands Still" - almost as though Time (or the Grim Reaper) is always there, we just move around it without seeing it.</td>', 'I rather like this.  Has sort of a ready made story going for it, but in addition to that, I like the motion blur against the crispness of the background.  The crossing adds a nice strong graphical element to it.  An alternate title might be "Time Stands Still" - almost as though Time (or the Grim Reaper) is always there, we just move around it without seeing it.', '2008-10-28 15:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029258, 733330, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not everyone''s idea of "street photography" but I like the simplicity, the anonymity (as your title suggests) of it.  Very nice lines as well.</td>', 'Perhaps not everyone''s idea of "street photography" but I like the simplicity, the anonymity (as your title suggests) of it.  Very nice lines as well.', '2008-10-28 15:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029262, 733661, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good capture in time of a nice moment with lots of good elements to see and almost hear.  I like how the bass player seems to be rather interested in something out of frame, but probably isn''t missing a beat.  Well composed.</td>', 'A good capture in time of a nice moment with lots of good elements to see and almost hear.  I like how the bass player seems to be rather interested in something out of frame, but probably isn''t missing a beat.  Well composed.', '2008-10-28 15:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029264, 733194, 30982, '<td valign="top">This fascinates me.  A wonderfully timed and seen capture, and rather haunting.  I''m trying to decide if this would work in B&amp;W, and I don''t think it would - needs to be in color.  Nice work!</td>', 'This fascinates me.  A wonderfully timed and seen capture, and rather haunting.  I''m trying to decide if this would work in B&W, and I don''t think it would - needs to be in color.  Nice work!', '2008-10-28 15:23:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029265, 733644, 30982, '<td valign="top">The thing I like about this one - are the couple on the left of the shot just strangers taking advantage of a photo op?  I know I do that sort of thing, but rarely stand there and chimp - I at least walk away first.  :-)  Also have to wonder where the hubby is?  ''Tis a nice photo to visit with - and that''s what street photography is all about to me.</td>', 'The thing I like about this one - are the couple on the left of the shot just strangers taking advantage of a photo op?  I know I do that sort of thing, but rarely stand there and chimp - I at least walk away first.  :-)  Also have to wonder where the hubby is?  ''Tis a nice photo to visit with - and that''s what street photography is all about to me.', '2008-10-28 15:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029266, 733790, 30982, '<td valign="top">A rather interesting take on the challenge, I''ll give it that!  Well composed, nice use of perspective.  But I''m betting this isn''t quite what folks had envisioned for a "street shot".</td>', 'A rather interesting take on the challenge, I''ll give it that!  Well composed, nice use of perspective.  But I''m betting this isn''t quite what folks had envisioned for a "street shot".', '2008-10-28 15:27:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029269, 733580, 30982, '<td valign="top">A pretty good candid, but there are some digitial artifacts that detract from the presentation.  On my monitor, her hair appears to be in little blocks - not sure what''s causing that.</td>', 'A pretty good candid, but there are some digitial artifacts that detract from the presentation.  On my monitor, her hair appears to be in little blocks - not sure what''s causing that.', '2008-10-28 15:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029280, 733226, 91975, '<td valign="top">too much photoshop :( it could be a nice picture if not shaken and overprosseced 3</td>', 'too much photoshop :( it could be a nice picture if not shaken and overprosseced 3', '2008-10-28 15:35:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5029293, 733480, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good use of shadow, though I can''t quite figure what''s casting the one next to the closest set of feet.  I like that this appears almost to have been shot through glass - was it?</td>', 'Good use of shadow, though I can''t quite figure what''s casting the one next to the closest set of feet.  I like that this appears almost to have been shot through glass - was it?', '2008-10-28 15:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029295, 733434, 49773, '<td valign="top">Looks kinda strange, like you added the noise. I like it.</td>', 'Looks kinda strange, like you added the noise. I like it.', '2008-10-28 15:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029296, 733787, 30982, '<td valign="top">The pose of the goose is quite demure - but overall the shot is just a tad dark on my monitor.</td>', 'The pose of the goose is quite demure - but overall the shot is just a tad dark on my monitor.', '2008-10-28 15:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029297, 733753, 30982, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure what you''re trying to show me - it appears to be a computer monitor of some kind, but the setting isn''t quite enough to give me the story, if that makes sense.</td>', 'Not quite sure what you''re trying to show me - it appears to be a computer monitor of some kind, but the setting isn''t quite enough to give me the story, if that makes sense.', '2008-10-28 15:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029299, 733729, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh - is it a real person with pumpkins strategically placed and a mask, or a mannequin as part of the store''s "welcome committee"?</td>', 'Heh - is it a real person with pumpkins strategically placed and a mask, or a mannequin as part of the store''s "welcome committee"?', '2008-10-28 15:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029329, 733767, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the two different expressions - the seemingly happy guy and the guy who''s on his cell phone.  They''re doing their job, but don''t seem too stressed over it!  A bit blurry - when shooting stuff like this and if you have the option, crank up the ISO so you can use a faster shutter speed.</td>', 'I like the two different expressions - the seemingly happy guy and the guy who''s on his cell phone.  They''re doing their job, but don''t seem too stressed over it!  A bit blurry - when shooting stuff like this and if you have the option, crank up the ISO so you can use a faster shutter speed.', '2008-10-28 16:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029341, 733890, 30982, '<td valign="top">I always find these guys just a bit unnerving - like if you don''t want them to squeegee your window, how do you indicate that?  This shot is just a tad dark for me - I find myself wanting to be able to see a bit more.</td>', 'I always find these guys just a bit unnerving - like if you don''t want them to squeegee your window, how do you indicate that?  This shot is just a tad dark for me - I find myself wanting to be able to see a bit more.', '2008-10-28 16:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029343, 733904, 811, '<td valign="top">I read your sign as 2 donuts for 10 dollars or 3 for 16.  I was wondering who on earth would pay over 5 dollars for a single doughnut.  d''oh.   got it now.  &lt;karmat goes to take some more reading lessons&gt;</td>', 'I read your sign as 2 donuts for 10 dollars or 3 for 16.  I was wondering who on earth would pay over 5 dollars for a single doughnut.  d''oh.   got it now.  <karmat goes to take some more reading lessons>', '2008-10-28 16:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029348, 733796, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is one of those that I''m sure works better in color with that bit of orange and the contrast of green.  Not sure what his mission is but he does seem determined to accomplish it.  Probably not going to meet some voters'' idea of a "street shot" but it''s pretty well composed and has a nice feel to it.</td>', 'This is one of those that I''m sure works better in color with that bit of orange and the contrast of green.  Not sure what his mission is but he does seem determined to accomplish it.  Probably not going to meet some voters'' idea of a "street shot" but it''s pretty well composed and has a nice feel to it.', '2008-10-28 16:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029349, 733468, 30982, '<td valign="top">You definitely caught a variety of looks in this one, and gotta say I don''t think I''ve ever seen a yard sale with a drive-through.  Has the feel of a drive by shooting, so to speak.</td>', 'You definitely caught a variety of looks in this one, and gotta say I don''t think I''ve ever seen a yard sale with a drive-through.  Has the feel of a drive by shooting, so to speak.', '2008-10-28 16:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
