(5029415, 732732, 30982, '<td valign="top">He''s nicely color coordinated with the leaves, but I''m otherwise unsure of the story here.  Perhaps it''s just a nice walk on a lovely fall day!</td>', 'He''s nicely color coordinated with the leaves, but I''m otherwise unsure of the story here.  Perhaps it''s just a nice walk on a lovely fall day!', '2008-10-28 16:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029416, 732646, 30982, '<td valign="top">A difficult lighting situation pretty well handled.  Love the whole outdoor barber thing, and the guy in the chair with not a whole lot of hair, waiting.  Also like the other guy watching the girls go by.  Interesting shot.</td>', 'A difficult lighting situation pretty well handled.  Love the whole outdoor barber thing, and the guy in the chair with not a whole lot of hair, waiting.  Also like the other guy watching the girls go by.  Interesting shot.', '2008-10-28 16:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029417, 733798, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really like the lines in this - the crossing marks and the building lines.  Very strong!  Cyclist is in a great location in the frame.  But to be honest, I''m not thrilled with the yellow.  I do fully understand that you did that intentionally - nice tie to the jacket (implying rain) and the match to the street lamp, and in that respect it''s successful.  My personal preference, though, would be all B&amp;W.  Still a very strong shot.</td>', 'I really like the lines in this - the crossing marks and the building lines.  Very strong!  Cyclist is in a great location in the frame.  But to be honest, I''m not thrilled with the yellow.  I do fully understand that you did that intentionally - nice tie to the jacket (implying rain) and the match to the street lamp, and in that respect it''s successful.  My personal preference, though, would be all B&W.  Still a very strong shot.', '2008-10-28 16:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029424, 733886, 80058, '<td valign="top">I love the character and expression you captured here. This has alot of potential but you could''ve worked with a 3rd of rules approach to get a better, stronger composition, maybe just by having done a tighter crop to achieve that would have been enough. My other idea to improve this would have been to convert it to black and white... as I can see a red circle from the traffic lights at the background which is quiet distracting and that could correct that and make your amazin candid shot the main focus of attention! Th way I vote tho is different from the rest here, I love the expression you captured and am givin u an 8!</td>', 'I love the character and expression you captured here. This has alot of potential but you could''ve worked with a 3rd of rules approach to get a better, stronger composition, maybe just by having done a tighter crop to achieve that would have been enough. My other idea to improve this would have been to convert it to black and white... as I can see a red circle from the traffic lights at the background which is quiet distracting and that could correct that and make your amazin candid shot the main focus of attention! Th way I vote tho is different from the rest here, I love the expression you captured and am givin u an 8!', '2008-10-28 16:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029425, 733794, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very powerful shot regardless of one''s political leanings.  No idea how you isolated the one guy (red hoodie, perhaps?) but that, with the angle, the masses, and the glint off something in the front, provides a very interesting shot.</td>', 'Very powerful shot regardless of one''s political leanings.  No idea how you isolated the one guy (red hoodie, perhaps?) but that, with the angle, the masses, and the glint off something in the front, provides a very interesting shot.', '2008-10-28 16:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029428, 733640, 30982, '<td valign="top">A simple clean street portrait - good uncluttered and pleasing setting, nice light.  Is he a photog?  I wonder because of the bag.</td>', 'A simple clean street portrait - good uncluttered and pleasing setting, nice light.  Is he a photog?  I wonder because of the bag.', '2008-10-28 16:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5029430, 733480, 80058, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmmm I would hope to see more in a street photography challenge... perhaps a shot like this would have worked if they had some sort of strikingly different pair of shoes but thats no really the case. Also I am not sure about the over processing of the shot, it lost alot of quality, overexposed some parts... but at the same time it did caught my attention and the more I look at it the more I open my mind to appreciating it =)</td>', 'Hmmmmmm I would hope to see more in a street photography challenge... perhaps a shot like this would have worked if they had some sort of strikingly different pair of shoes but thats no really the case. Also I am not sure about the over processing of the shot, it lost alot of quality, overexposed some parts... but at the same time it did caught my attention and the more I look at it the more I open my mind to appreciating it =)', '2008-10-28 16:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
