(5029447, 733317, 80058, '<td valign="top">Lovely low angle going on, as well as a very lively background, my main complaint is that is not sharp enough!! I wish his face was sharply focused with more motion blur on his arm perhaps? =) 6 great find!</td>', 'Lovely low angle going on, as well as a very lively background, my main complaint is that is not sharp enough!! I wish his face was sharply focused with more motion blur on his arm perhaps? =) 6 great find!', '2008-10-28 17:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
