(5030048, 733902, 62249, '<td valign="top">Ha! It''s like flamingoes on parade. Lots of interesting elements in this. I like the back of the guy''s head between the two "birds." Like the curvy thing extending off the left (but don''t be surprised if some folks think it looks like a tail). Like the shadows. Good job!</td>', 'Ha! It''s like flamingoes on parade. Lots of interesting elements in this. I like the back of the guy''s head between the two "birds." Like the curvy thing extending off the left (but don''t be surprised if some folks think it looks like a tail). Like the shadows. Good job!', '2008-10-29 00:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
