(5030326, 733897, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a sleepy little town kind of feel to it.</td>', 'Has a sleepy little town kind of feel to it.', '2008-10-29 05:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030327, 733898, 30982, '<td valign="top">One should always take a couple of kegs along when heading out to hunt with guns and stuff.  (Heh - that''s just my take on it.)  Definitely rural America kind of thing.  I take it from your title you''re pointing out the gentleman on the far left wishing he were accompanying those kegs of beer, wherever it is they''re going.</td>', 'One should always take a couple of kegs along when heading out to hunt with guns and stuff.  (Heh - that''s just my take on it.)  Definitely rural America kind of thing.  I take it from your title you''re pointing out the gentleman on the far left wishing he were accompanying those kegs of beer, wherever it is they''re going.', '2008-10-29 05:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030328, 733140, 30982, '<td valign="top">Has a fun energy to it - lots of action, things going on - just kind of a nice afternoon event kind of thing.</td>', 'Has a fun energy to it - lots of action, things going on - just kind of a nice afternoon event kind of thing.', '2008-10-29 05:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030329, 733894, 30982, '<td valign="top">While I can see the bricks and rail beyond, the close nature of this shot doesn''t particularly lend itself to "street photography" with respect to the environment playing a part in the story.</td>', 'While I can see the bricks and rail beyond, the close nature of this shot doesn''t particularly lend itself to "street photography" with respect to the environment playing a part in the story.', '2008-10-29 05:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030383, 733424, 27161, '<td valign="top">AAAaah...<br/> <br/>Oh, I thought it was coming after me.  Superb shot.  I love it.</td>', 'AAAaah... Oh, I thought it was coming after me.  Superb shot.  I love it.', '2008-10-29 07:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030494, 733465, 58272, '<td valign="top">Fantastic idea! Very cool, and pulled off well, though I''ll have to admit that it doesn''t fit the stereotypical idea of street photography.</td>', 'Fantastic idea! Very cool, and pulled off well, though I''ll have to admit that it doesn''t fit the stereotypical idea of street photography.', '2008-10-29 09:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
