(5030508, 733640, 58272, '<td valign="top">I love the expression you''ve captured here. The simple composition works well and allows the viewer to soak in other details such as texture and contrast.</td>', 'I love the expression you''ve captured here. The simple composition works well and allows the viewer to soak in other details such as texture and contrast.', '2008-10-29 09:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5030514, 733149, 49773, '<td valign="top">This flat facade looks like it''s sucking every living form inside through those little holes. It looks like it has already sucked all of the leaves and the only escape is to go towards the light. Well, the tree was not lucky.</td>', 'This flat facade looks like it''s sucking every living form inside through those little holes. It looks like it has already sucked all of the leaves and the only escape is to go towards the light. Well, the tree was not lucky.', '2008-10-29 09:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
