(5030784, 733480, 64742, '<td valign="top">Like the processing</td>', 'Like the processing', '2008-10-29 10:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031032, 733524, 38162, '<td valign="top">Im scoring this very high - great concept but the title is just waaaay too long and unnecessary.  let the image tell the story.  just "women shopping" would do it, or "women love bags".  whatever.  great concept. gl</td>', 'Im scoring this very high - great concept but the title is just waaaay too long and unnecessary.  let the image tell the story.  just "women shopping" would do it, or "women love bags".  whatever.  great concept. gl', '2008-10-29 12:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031211, 733715, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the raindrops and the fact you caught your subject mid-air.  Also interesting that while the sign says Open, the building looks rather deserted.</td>', 'I like the raindrops and the fact you caught your subject mid-air.  Also interesting that while the sign says Open, the building looks rather deserted.', '2008-10-29 13:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031236, 733705, 30982, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a pretty good job of isolating your subject from a busy scene.</td>', 'You''ve done a pretty good job of isolating your subject from a busy scene.', '2008-10-29 14:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031241, 733909, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, I think I get it now - the two stop signs.  For a minute I thought it was between beer stops.  :-)  Your subjects are a bit small to really get an idea of the story.</td>', 'Ah, I think I get it now - the two stop signs.  For a minute I thought it was between beer stops.  :-)  Your subjects are a bit small to really get an idea of the story.', '2008-10-29 14:01:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031245, 733547, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting thing is the reflection doesn''t seem to be that of the foreground subject.</td>', 'Interesting thing is the reflection doesn''t seem to be that of the foreground subject.', '2008-10-29 14:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031250, 732927, 30982, '<td valign="top">My guess is you''re showing me the guy sitting with the hat out looking for cash donations.  Either that or he''s checking out the girl (?) who just walked by.</td>', 'My guess is you''re showing me the guy sitting with the hat out looking for cash donations.  Either that or he''s checking out the girl (?) who just walked by.', '2008-10-29 14:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031255, 733695, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and I like the colors you ended up with here.</td>', 'Nice composition and I like the colors you ended up with here.', '2008-10-29 14:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031258, 733870, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kind of an interesting juxtaposition - Harley folks at some sort of country festival, but can''t really tell what the setting is for sure.  Good crisp B&amp;W.</td>', 'Kind of an interesting juxtaposition - Harley folks at some sort of country festival, but can''t really tell what the setting is for sure.  Good crisp B&W.', '2008-10-29 14:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031261, 733915, 30982, '<td valign="top">Yep, one sees many folks playing with their cell phones or other hand held devices these days.  Maybe he''s trying to get a date?  I suspect he''s texting someone.</td>', 'Yep, one sees many folks playing with their cell phones or other hand held devices these days.  Maybe he''s trying to get a date?  I suspect he''s texting someone.', '2008-10-29 14:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031263, 733810, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very much like the light and the very long, prominent shadow of the guy pushing the cart.</td>', 'Very much like the light and the very long, prominent shadow of the guy pushing the cart.', '2008-10-29 14:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031265, 733815, 30982, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the vibrant color of this which seems well suited the vibrant caricatures it appears he produces.  Nice shot of an artist at work.</td>', 'I enjoy the vibrant color of this which seems well suited the vibrant caricatures it appears he produces.  Nice shot of an artist at work.', '2008-10-29 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031268, 733382, 30982, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not everyone''s idea of "street photography" but it''s a nice quiet shot and pleasing in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Perhaps not everyone''s idea of "street photography" but it''s a nice quiet shot and pleasing in B&W.', '2008-10-29 14:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031269, 733887, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming she''s with him, but has paused to take in something he either missed or is not interested in.  Kind of a nice commentary on how two people can be a couple yet have a very different shared experience.</td>', 'I''m assuming she''s with him, but has paused to take in something he either missed or is not interested in.  Kind of a nice commentary on how two people can be a couple yet have a very different shared experience.', '2008-10-29 14:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031273, 733524, 30982, '<td valign="top">She (being the real one) seems totally unphased by the Giant Shopping Woman.  Nice choice of person to walk by, given that her clothing and bag suit the poster (ie B&amp;W).  Only the hint of color on her skin gives her away.</td>', 'She (being the real one) seems totally unphased by the Giant Shopping Woman.  Nice choice of person to walk by, given that her clothing and bag suit the poster (ie B&W).  Only the hint of color on her skin gives her away.', '2008-10-29 14:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031275, 733917, 30982, '<td valign="top">I always wonder if the pets get into the costume thing as much as the owners, though I suspect they''ll put up with darn near anything to get out of the house.  The dog has an appropriately embarassed look, like "It wasn''t my idea!!"</td>', 'I always wonder if the pets get into the costume thing as much as the owners, though I suspect they''ll put up with darn near anything to get out of the house.  The dog has an appropriately embarassed look, like "It wasn''t my idea!!"', '2008-10-29 14:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031277, 733896, 30982, '<td valign="top">He looks rather content despite his somewhat odd expression.  Lovely long shadows.</td>', 'He looks rather content despite his somewhat odd expression.  Lovely long shadows.', '2008-10-29 14:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031280, 733566, 30982, '<td valign="top">Are they watching for guys or checking out the competition?  I like how the four seem to echo the four on the poster across the way, only younger and perhaps not as well adorned.</td>', 'Are they watching for guys or checking out the competition?  I like how the four seem to echo the four on the poster across the way, only younger and perhaps not as well adorned.', '2008-10-29 14:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031282, 733739, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, there were two of you shooting this.  Interesting difference in perspectives between the two shots.  Was traffic behind expecting to pass or were people parked there?</td>', 'Ah, there were two of you shooting this.  Interesting difference in perspectives between the two shots.  Was traffic behind expecting to pass or were people parked there?', '2008-10-29 14:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031284, 733902, 30982, '<td valign="top">This made me smile - both the shot itself and the title.  One of the rare occasions where selective desat serves a purpose.</td>', 'This made me smile - both the shot itself and the title.  One of the rare occasions where selective desat serves a purpose.', '2008-10-29 14:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031286, 733795, 30982, '<td valign="top">A lovely candid of a very attractive young woman.</td>', 'A lovely candid of a very attractive young woman.', '2008-10-29 14:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031302, 733434, 30982, '<td valign="top">A classic kind of street shot, pretty well done.  I do like the grain/noise but it''s almost a bit too uniform - not sure how to change that, but I''m sure there are ways.  Nice softness to the B&amp;W.</td>', 'A classic kind of street shot, pretty well done.  I do like the grain/noise but it''s almost a bit too uniform - not sure how to change that, but I''m sure there are ways.  Nice softness to the B&W.', '2008-10-29 14:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031303, 733885, 30982, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the contented look on the dog''s face.  Totally steals the show in this shot.</td>', 'I LOVE the contented look on the dog''s face.  Totally steals the show in this shot.', '2008-10-29 14:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031312, 733391, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks to be a bit windy, both from the balloons and the lady in the brown coat.  He doesn''t look all that excited about his job at the moment, either.</td>', 'Looks to be a bit windy, both from the balloons and the lady in the brown coat.  He doesn''t look all that excited about his job at the moment, either.', '2008-10-29 14:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031439, 732443, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great background to hang by - good lines, clean, works well in monochrome.  Kind of a neat play on the store name with the upright homo sapiens strolling by.</td>', 'Great background to hang by - good lines, clean, works well in monochrome.  Kind of a neat play on the store name with the upright homo sapiens strolling by.', '2008-10-29 15:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031443, 733883, 30982, '<td valign="top">He''s a handsome hansom cab driver - kinda looks a little like Kevin Costner.  Nice processing to bring out the shades of brown.</td>', 'He''s a handsome hansom cab driver - kinda looks a little like Kevin Costner.  Nice processing to bring out the shades of brown.', '2008-10-29 15:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031444, 733062, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like the sun blaring in at the top and the line of arches from the lamps.  Looks like the end of a lovely day.</td>', 'I quite like the sun blaring in at the top and the line of arches from the lamps.  Looks like the end of a lovely day.', '2008-10-29 15:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031445, 732866, 30982, '<td valign="top">Ah, are they sneaking a cigarette or something more devious and dangerous?  I like the echoed forms of the girls.</td>', 'Ah, are they sneaking a cigarette or something more devious and dangerous?  I like the echoed forms of the girls.', '2008-10-29 15:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031447, 733584, 30982, '<td valign="top">Makes me smile.  I, too, am fond of the power nap.  Nice light, very nice detail and works well in color.  I like the bits of ears showing</td>', 'Makes me smile.  I, too, am fond of the power nap.  Nice light, very nice detail and works well in color.  I like the bits of ears showing', '2008-10-29 15:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031450, 733803, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a fun shot to me because of the repeated action/posture of the two sets of gentlemen.  I particularly like the younger set.  One indeed wonders what stories are being swapped here.  Also like the reflections of orange and yellow from the younger gents'' jackets to the trees behind.</td>', 'This is a fun shot to me because of the repeated action/posture of the two sets of gentlemen.  I particularly like the younger set.  One indeed wonders what stories are being swapped here.  Also like the reflections of orange and yellow from the younger gents'' jackets to the trees behind.', '2008-10-29 15:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031457, 733886, 30982, '<td valign="top">A simple and casual street portrait - carries a bit of motion - walking toward you.  I find myself drawn to the young lady behind him and the buttons on her coat.  Not a bad thing - just where my eyes go.  I like the nearly triangular composition formed by the people, too.</td>', 'A simple and casual street portrait - carries a bit of motion - walking toward you.  I find myself drawn to the young lady behind him and the buttons on her coat.  Not a bad thing - just where my eyes go.  I like the nearly triangular composition formed by the people, too.', '2008-10-29 15:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031460, 732913, 30982, '<td valign="top">He looks as though his nose has been broken a time or two, probably in the pub he''s waiting to enter or one like it.  I really like the reflections - adds a lot to this shot.</td>', 'He looks as though his nose has been broken a time or two, probably in the pub he''s waiting to enter or one like it.  I really like the reflections - adds a lot to this shot.', '2008-10-29 15:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031463, 733363, 30982, '<td valign="top">The kitten adds an "aww" factor to this.  I just hope he actually cares for it and doesn''t just use it to get more donations because of the cuteness factor.  Color works pretty well here.</td>', 'The kitten adds an "aww" factor to this.  I just hope he actually cares for it and doesn''t just use it to get more donations because of the cuteness factor.  Color works pretty well here.', '2008-10-29 15:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031465, 733529, 30982, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit snap-shottish but I like how the adults both look just a little like "OK, here, look, now let''s go."  There seems to be just a bit of impatience on their parts.  I like how both girls also have their dollies.</td>', 'Maybe a bit snap-shottish but I like how the adults both look just a little like "OK, here, look, now let''s go."  There seems to be just a bit of impatience on their parts.  I like how both girls also have their dollies.', '2008-10-29 15:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031467, 733387, 30982, '<td valign="top">Definitely a different take on the challenge.  The ghosts appear very crisp, almost unnervingly so.  I think it would be more effective with just one, though I suspect there are three for a reason I''m missing.</td>', 'Definitely a different take on the challenge.  The ghosts appear very crisp, almost unnervingly so.  I think it would be more effective with just one, though I suspect there are three for a reason I''m missing.', '2008-10-29 15:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031470, 733530, 30982, '<td valign="top">While I suspect you really wanted the woman in the jaws, it''s the child running across the way with the ship behind that truly makes this work.  I do like the unbalanced border - I think it works nicely here.</td>', 'While I suspect you really wanted the woman in the jaws, it''s the child running across the way with the ship behind that truly makes this work.  I do like the unbalanced border - I think it works nicely here.', '2008-10-29 15:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031471, 733265, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good use of the wide angle to catch all the action going on here.</td>', 'Good use of the wide angle to catch all the action going on here.', '2008-10-29 15:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031499, 733604, 30982, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t sure at first, but I''ve decided I do like the glowy processing - has a sorta surreal feel to it that somehow matches the shot itself.  Love the building.  My only suggestion (and I know it''s a freakin'' silly suggestion) would be to have let the gentleman walk two more steps to the left.</td>', 'Wasn''t sure at first, but I''ve decided I do like the glowy processing - has a sorta surreal feel to it that somehow matches the shot itself.  Love the building.  My only suggestion (and I know it''s a freakin'' silly suggestion) would be to have let the gentleman walk two more steps to the left.', '2008-10-29 16:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031503, 733571, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nicely spaced, including the guy inside who although he''s not out with these gents, still seems to be part of the "group" so to speak.</td>', 'Nicely spaced, including the guy inside who although he''s not out with these gents, still seems to be part of the "group" so to speak.', '2008-10-29 16:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031525, 732973, 30982, '<td valign="top">Great color - the "peach" really works well against all that blue.</td>', 'Great color - the "peach" really works well against all that blue.', '2008-10-29 16:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031526, 733888, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like this - and yep, I''d imagine there are some odd things to be had.  He seems both rather amused and pleased with his find.</td>', 'I quite like this - and yep, I''d imagine there are some odd things to be had.  He seems both rather amused and pleased with his find.', '2008-10-29 16:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031529, 733438, 96626, '<td valign="top">Thème de la rencontre, donc plutot classique, mais vraiment bien traité, de part la technique photographique... Entraperçue, il ne reste qu''une image fugitive sur la rétine, précieux moment volé au flux urbain... un souvenir<br/> <br/>A classical Idee, but this is here realy well done... don''t you find the photography''s treatment really appropriated ?! remember...</td>', 'Thème de la rencontre, donc plutot classique, mais vraiment bien traité, de part la technique photographique... Entraperçue, il ne reste qu''une image fugitive sur la rétine, précieux moment volé au flux urbain... un souvenir A classical Idee, but this is here realy well done... don''t you find the photography''s treatment really appropriated ?! remember...', '2008-10-29 16:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031576, 733674, 30982, '<td valign="top">His boots and slacks don''t look particularly "street" to me - indeed he looks quite at home.  But I do like the textures here - very nice conversion to B&amp;W as well.</td>', 'His boots and slacks don''t look particularly "street" to me - indeed he looks quite at home.  But I do like the textures here - very nice conversion to B&W as well.', '2008-10-29 16:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031579, 733114, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the wide view of this and the glimpses into the people who have gathered here.</td>', 'I like the wide view of this and the glimpses into the people who have gathered here.', '2008-10-29 16:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031580, 733385, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''ll take your word for the dope bit.  They look like they''re having a nice afternoon - I just hope he''s not about to throw a lit cigarette at the dog, who seems quite happy to be going about his day.</td>', 'I''ll take your word for the dope bit.  They look like they''re having a nice afternoon - I just hope he''s not about to throw a lit cigarette at the dog, who seems quite happy to be going about his day.', '2008-10-29 16:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031582, 733871, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good street portrait of a man with a lot of character in his face.  Excellent detail.</td>', 'Good street portrait of a man with a lot of character in his face.  Excellent detail.', '2008-10-29 16:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031587, 733775, 30982, '<td valign="top">Kinda looks like Marac.  Love the blues of this, with that touch of warmth coming from the window.  Excellent location, nicely composed and exposed shot.  Like the girl (I think it''s a girl) with the nifty hat at the next table, too.</td>', 'Kinda looks like Marac.  Love the blues of this, with that touch of warmth coming from the window.  Excellent location, nicely composed and exposed shot.  Like the girl (I think it''s a girl) with the nifty hat at the next table, too.', '2008-10-29 16:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031599, 733816, 30982, '<td valign="top">The gentleman in the suit has a very purposeful stride and concerned appearance.  He''s either deep in thought or something has not gone right for him.  I like that comparison against the rest of the folks, who all seem so much more casual.</td>', 'The gentleman in the suit has a very purposeful stride and concerned appearance.  He''s either deep in thought or something has not gone right for him.  I like that comparison against the rest of the folks, who all seem so much more casual.', '2008-10-29 17:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031602, 733756, 30982, '<td valign="top">I think I like both perspectives (this one and the other similar shot) - gives two views of the same thing.  Can''t tell for sure but it looks as if they young lady posing has her eyes closed?  Nice car, by the way!</td>', 'I think I like both perspectives (this one and the other similar shot) - gives two views of the same thing.  Can''t tell for sure but it looks as if they young lady posing has her eyes closed?  Nice car, by the way!', '2008-10-29 17:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031603, 733708, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very busy (which I like) and colorful.  Nice composition to this but not sure what the story is with the two gentleman.  I do wonder how the one hurt his hand - and it looks as though he has a shoeshine block but the other guy won''t be a customer - wrong kind of shoes.</td>', 'Very busy (which I like) and colorful.  Nice composition to this but not sure what the story is with the two gentleman.  I do wonder how the one hurt his hand - and it looks as though he has a shoeshine block but the other guy won''t be a customer - wrong kind of shoes.', '2008-10-29 17:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031606, 733560, 30982, '<td valign="top">This works well - the blue color seems to match the blue mood presented.  Good detail, good composition.</td>', 'This works well - the blue color seems to match the blue mood presented.  Good detail, good composition.', '2008-10-29 17:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031609, 733899, 30982, '<td valign="top">The gap does seem to be symbolic of the distances people keep from each other, just as the wall separates the pavement from the water.  Well seen.</td>', 'The gap does seem to be symbolic of the distances people keep from each other, just as the wall separates the pavement from the water.  Well seen.', '2008-10-29 17:05:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031610, 733738, 30982, '<td valign="top">A dull dreary sort of day - the kind of day that might suit someone''s mood who is cleaning up after others.  I like the leading lines of the behnces, and I do like the tilt.</td>', 'A dull dreary sort of day - the kind of day that might suit someone''s mood who is cleaning up after others.  I like the leading lines of the behnces, and I do like the tilt.', '2008-10-29 17:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031612, 733793, 30982, '<td valign="top">Their expressions - his of one who''s just done or said something silly and hers of "you''re too funny!" - are what makes this a very fun shot.  The color also suits - bright and cheerful to match their mood.</td>', 'Their expressions - his of one who''s just done or said something silly and hers of "you''re too funny!" - are what makes this a very fun shot.  The color also suits - bright and cheerful to match their mood.', '2008-10-29 17:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031615, 733701, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the impression these two are together, just in the proximity of each other.  A nice glance into two different expressions.</td>', 'I don''t get the impression these two are together, just in the proximity of each other.  A nice glance into two different expressions.', '2008-10-29 17:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031619, 733714, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like that streak of light that runs up over the bench he''s sitting on.  I would suspect he''s enjoying a moment''s quiet while waiting for a bus.  The color works well in this.</td>', 'I like that streak of light that runs up over the bench he''s sitting on.  I would suspect he''s enjoying a moment''s quiet while waiting for a bus.  The color works well in this.', '2008-10-29 17:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031621, 733784, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good angle to keep the distractions to a minimum.  I like the way the ground forms a very strong texture around him.</td>', 'Good angle to keep the distractions to a minimum.  I like the way the ground forms a very strong texture around him.', '2008-10-29 17:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031624, 733077, 30982, '<td valign="top">Looks like a nice little cafe, but can''t help but think it would be better with a person or two to give it some life.</td>', 'Looks like a nice little cafe, but can''t help but think it would be better with a person or two to give it some life.', '2008-10-29 17:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031628, 733873, 30982, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is a corrider where there''s some form of public transportation - very nicely decorated!  Like the use of the fisheye/ultrawide to shape the place, and the way your people are very nearly silhouettes like the critters on the walls.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is a corrider where there''s some form of public transportation - very nicely decorated!  Like the use of the fisheye/ultrawide to shape the place, and the way your people are very nearly silhouettes like the critters on the walls.', '2008-10-29 17:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031632, 732507, 30982, '<td valign="top">She does not look especially pleased with you taking her picture.  Since we have a lot of those annoying cables with the trains here, I''m quite used to them, but there are those who will find them "distracting".</td>', 'She does not look especially pleased with you taking her picture.  Since we have a lot of those annoying cables with the trains here, I''m quite used to them, but there are those who will find them "distracting".', '2008-10-29 17:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031633, 733340, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very good street/environmental portrait.  Very good light, excellent detail, and commanding eyes.</td>', 'A very good street/environmental portrait.  Very good light, excellent detail, and commanding eyes.', '2008-10-29 17:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031649, 732443, 88480, '<td valign="top">VERY INTERESTING SHOT LOVE THE WAY YOU CAPTURE THIS SHOOT THE WOMEN WALKING PASS THE SIGN JUST SO PEACEFUL IS AMAZING AND LOVE THE BLACK &amp; WHITE STYLE LOVE THE SHOOT</td>', 'VERY INTERESTING SHOT LOVE THE WAY YOU CAPTURE THIS SHOOT THE WOMEN WALKING PASS THE SIGN JUST SO PEACEFUL IS AMAZING AND LOVE THE BLACK & WHITE STYLE LOVE THE SHOOT', '2008-10-29 17:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031669, 733889, 30982, '<td valign="top">The elements of this come together well in my opinion.  My focus is the smaller birds in the surf, but the man, the crest of the wave, and the reflections from the shallow water all balance those birds out nicely.  Probably not your typical "street" shot, but a very pleasing photograph.</td>', 'The elements of this come together well in my opinion.  My focus is the smaller birds in the surf, but the man, the crest of the wave, and the reflections from the shallow water all balance those birds out nicely.  Probably not your typical "street" shot, but a very pleasing photograph.', '2008-10-29 17:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031671, 733908, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  The bright red behind him really gives this a warmth and liveliness.  Goes well with the shirt, too.  Nicely seen, well composed.</td>', 'Very nice!  The bright red behind him really gives this a warmth and liveliness.  Goes well with the shirt, too.  Nicely seen, well composed.', '2008-10-29 17:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031673, 733280, 30982, '<td valign="top">He looks to be a very friendly and engaging man - I like the way you''ve captured his spirit.  This photograph seems to suit him.  If you have the opportunity to do so, you should print this and give him a copy.</td>', 'He looks to be a very friendly and engaging man - I like the way you''ve captured his spirit.  This photograph seems to suit him.  If you have the opportunity to do so, you should print this and give him a copy.', '2008-10-29 17:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031674, 733424, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Be sure to post this in the Pigeon thread after the challenge.  And they do most certainly look like a gang of young thugs - hanging out and undoubtedly causing problems.  This might also work well in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Heh!  Be sure to post this in the Pigeon thread after the challenge.  And they do most certainly look like a gang of young thugs - hanging out and undoubtedly causing problems.  This might also work well in B&W.', '2008-10-29 17:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031676, 733226, 30982, '<td valign="top">"Soulful" really does suit this well.  I really like your choice of composition, from the low angle and incorporating the full tower.  I''m kinda on the fence about the processing, but I suspect the long exposure led to motion blur and this does address that, making a more cohesive "figure" so to speak.</td>', '"Soulful" really does suit this well.  I really like your choice of composition, from the low angle and incorporating the full tower.  I''m kinda on the fence about the processing, but I suspect the long exposure led to motion blur and this does address that, making a more cohesive "figure" so to speak.', '2008-10-29 17:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031678, 733665, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very striking to my eye - I like the boldness of the lines and the smallness of the couple in the scene.  Adds a bit of poignancy, if that''s a word.  Another one I might like to see if it works in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Very striking to my eye - I like the boldness of the lines and the smallness of the couple in the scene.  Adds a bit of poignancy, if that''s a word.  Another one I might like to see if it works in B&W.', '2008-10-29 17:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031957, 733873, 4493, '<td valign="top">The use of color and fisheye make the shot interesting. I may have framed without the person on the right leaving just the one on the left leading out the frame into the light. Normally I''d try not to have something bright like that right on the edge of the frame, but with the person walking out it, it adds interest. Just wish there was a hair more space to the left of him.</td>', 'The use of color and fisheye make the shot interesting. I may have framed without the person on the right leaving just the one on the left leading out the frame into the light. Normally I''d try not to have something bright like that right on the edge of the frame, but with the person walking out it, it adds interest. Just wish there was a hair more space to the left of him.', '2008-10-29 21:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031964, 733824, 4493, '<td valign="top">Your framing of the shot is fine. The subject doesn''t draw me in. Having the person somewhere else in frame, or doing something other than just standing there may help.</td>', 'Your framing of the shot is fine. The subject doesn''t draw me in. Having the person somewhere else in frame, or doing something other than just standing there may help.', '2008-10-29 21:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031967, 732711, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the scene is protesting, but I like the framing color and emotion in the shot... your title on the other hand ;-)</td>', 'Not sure what the scene is protesting, but I like the framing color and emotion in the shot... your title on the other hand ;-)', '2008-10-29 21:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031973, 733897, 4493, '<td valign="top">White balance is off, the tree is too heavy into the frame, no central subject matter, overall the image lacks interest to pull the viewer in.</td>', 'White balance is off, the tree is too heavy into the frame, no central subject matter, overall the image lacks interest to pull the viewer in.', '2008-10-29 21:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031977, 733438, 4493, '<td valign="top">While I like the square crop, I think the traffic light and wire at the top pull the eye away from your subject. The image otherwise is outstanding and a great capture with good post processing. Crop it down just a little on the top, and you have a frameable photo to be proud of.</td>', 'While I like the square crop, I think the traffic light and wire at the top pull the eye away from your subject. The image otherwise is outstanding and a great capture with good post processing. Crop it down just a little on the top, and you have a frameable photo to be proud of.', '2008-10-29 21:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031982, 733468, 4493, '<td valign="top">I think having the subject looking at the camera adds interest, but otherwise I feel this shot is a shot you took while walking by. There appears to be little post processing to enhance the main subject, which I take as the person holding the sign. There is a lot of distraction going on. Zoom in, crop, dodge and burn, do something to bring your subject as the main focal point so the viewer doesn''t just wander through the shot.</td>', 'I think having the subject looking at the camera adds interest, but otherwise I feel this shot is a shot you took while walking by. There appears to be little post processing to enhance the main subject, which I take as the person holding the sign. There is a lot of distraction going on. Zoom in, crop, dodge and burn, do something to bring your subject as the main focal point so the viewer doesn''t just wander through the shot.', '2008-10-29 21:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031985, 733585, 4493, '<td valign="top">Beautiful b/w conversion. Nice energy overall. Only one thing that I might do is crop off some off the top of the image to bring the viewer down to the subject matter first.</td>', 'Beautiful b/w conversion. Nice energy overall. Only one thing that I might do is crop off some off the top of the image to bring the viewer down to the subject matter first.', '2008-10-29 21:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031990, 733492, 4493, '<td valign="top">Focus in on the main subject by cropping off the edges of the image. They pull my eyes off the people. Also, while not easily done, if you captured her with the cup to her mouth it''d have added life to the shot. As it is, it''s a pretty dormant image.</td>', 'Focus in on the main subject by cropping off the edges of the image. They pull my eyes off the people. Also, while not easily done, if you captured her with the cup to her mouth it''d have added life to the shot. As it is, it''s a pretty dormant image.', '2008-10-29 21:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031995, 733876, 4493, '<td valign="top">Overall nice shot. I like your post processing. Looking at it though, the bricks on the right pull my eye away from the man (main subject). Try cropping off the right bricks and you may find that this makes the image a stronger composition.</td>', 'Overall nice shot. I like your post processing. Looking at it though, the bricks on the right pull my eye away from the man (main subject). Try cropping off the right bricks and you may find that this makes the image a stronger composition.', '2008-10-29 21:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5031998, 733529, 4493, '<td valign="top">Grandma and Grandpa take kids to the wall and then what? This image has no story and doesn''t pull the viewer into the shot. Framing, post processing, subject matter don''t make for a strong image.</td>', 'Grandma and Grandpa take kids to the wall and then what? This image has no story and doesn''t pull the viewer into the shot. Framing, post processing, subject matter don''t make for a strong image.', '2008-10-29 21:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032003, 733265, 4493, '<td valign="top">Great combination of subject matter, framing, and post processing. The fact that everyone is avoiding eye contact with her makes for a better story. Good shot!</td>', 'Great combination of subject matter, framing, and post processing. The fact that everyone is avoiding eye contact with her makes for a better story. Good shot!', '2008-10-29 21:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032005, 733715, 4493, '<td valign="top">Rain drops are nice, otherwise the image feels like a random capture entered into the challenge.</td>', 'Rain drops are nice, otherwise the image feels like a random capture entered into the challenge.', '2008-10-29 21:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032011, 733194, 4493, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the lady coming up the stairs, but your post processing has me distracted with the halos around the hand and feet.</td>', 'I like the composition with the lady coming up the stairs, but your post processing has me distracted with the halos around the hand and feet.', '2008-10-29 21:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032058, 733856, 4493, '<td valign="top">Capture the face and convert to black and white and you have a strong picture. As it is with the high sun, the subject looking away, we can almost feel his pain, but there is too much left for us to try and figure out.</td>', 'Capture the face and convert to black and white and you have a strong picture. As it is with the high sun, the subject looking away, we can almost feel his pain, but there is too much left for us to try and figure out.', '2008-10-29 21:56:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032085, 733633, 4493, '<td valign="top">What are you telling me with this photo? I see a leg out an open door. Not much else going on here. The composition is ok, but without a main subject the image doesn''t hold the viewer''s interest.</td>', 'What are you telling me with this photo? I see a leg out an open door. Not much else going on here. The composition is ok, but without a main subject the image doesn''t hold the viewer''s interest.', '2008-10-29 22:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032094, 733697, 14211, '<td valign="top">i feel the fun ...9</td>', 'i feel the fun ...9', '2008-10-29 22:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032104, 733584, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m not the first to comment on this, but he looks dead, not napping. When dealing with this many textures and patterns a black and white conversion may improve the feel of the image. Your subject and composition has a hard time capturing the viewers attention and there is no overall movement in the image. My eye is stuck on the cane.</td>', 'I''m sure I''m not the first to comment on this, but he looks dead, not napping. When dealing with this many textures and patterns a black and white conversion may improve the feel of the image. Your subject and composition has a hard time capturing the viewers attention and there is no overall movement in the image. My eye is stuck on the cane.', '2008-10-29 22:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032118, 733435, 4493, '<td valign="top">Moving the browser size I cropped off the top of the image from above the white wall on the right, making it almost a square composition, and I find that it is a stronger image keeping the eye down to your subject matter. Don''t be afraid to crop out things that pull the eye away from your main subject.</td>', 'Moving the browser size I cropped off the top of the image from above the white wall on the right, making it almost a square composition, and I find that it is a stronger image keeping the eye down to your subject matter. Don''t be afraid to crop out things that pull the eye away from your main subject.', '2008-10-29 22:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032119, 733465, 14211, '<td valign="top">it''s a wow....&amp; a 10</td>', 'it''s a wow....& a 10', '2008-10-29 22:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032124, 733822, 79357, '<td valign="top">Technically not so good but awesome atmosphere</td>', 'Technically not so good but awesome atmosphere', '2008-10-29 22:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032167, 733330, 33672, '<td valign="top">Perfect. 10</td>', 'Perfect. 10', '2008-10-29 22:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032170, 733486, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very nice...10</td>', 'Very nice...10', '2008-10-29 22:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032176, 733801, 33672, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the theme.10</td>', 'One of the best in the theme.10', '2008-10-29 22:35:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5032177, 733480, 33672, '<td valign="top">The pure essence of street photography.10</td>', 'The pure essence of street photography.10', '2008-10-29 22:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032178, 733631, 33672, '<td valign="top">Pure street photography. 10</td>', 'Pure street photography. 10', '2008-10-29 22:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032182, 733560, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and gritty feel. Good street photography.</td>', 'Nice tones and gritty feel. Good street photography.', '2008-10-29 22:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032183, 733265, 33672, '<td valign="top">Que Sera''. Great work.8</td>', 'Que Sera''. Great work.8', '2008-10-29 22:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032184, 732443, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. great tones.</td>', 'Nice capture. great tones.', '2008-10-29 22:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032234, 733505, 50695, '<td valign="top">this is so not street photography, but I just wanted to say that it''s a great picture.</td>', 'this is so not street photography, but I just wanted to say that it''s a great picture.', '2008-10-29 23:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032267, 733351, 25890, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...Why would there be a painting like that on a wall out on the street like that? But let''s never mind that; a bit odd at first but not terribly interesting in and of itself. The image in its entirety, however, is a different story. On one hand, I see a contradiction between the wholly inelegant, sterile, characterless, utilitarian desing of the van and the painting into which one assumes that a great deal of passion, care, love (or hate, or both, as the case may be) and self, not to mention a lot of hard work, was poured. This, for some reason, immediately reminds me of what Wilde once said about making a useful thing being forgivable as long as the maker does not admire it and the only excuse for making a useless thing being that the maker admires it intensely...And then on the other hand, we have curious parallels between the positions of the two men''s bodies, and between the open door of the truck and the woman on whose lap the man rests his head. I''d rather go no further than having noted these on a solely visual level, and leave the momentarily fun and exciting yet ultimately useless intellectual exercise of trying to find profound meanings and messages to others. I''d just like to say that rarely do I find myself wanting to look at an image for longer than 5 seconds (Regardless of how scintillating an image the photographer thinks it is) and even more rarely (more like "hardly ever"), being inspired to write a longer-than-five-words comment like this...10</td>', 'Hmmm...Why would there be a painting like that on a wall out on the street like that? But let''s never mind that; a bit odd at first but not terribly interesting in and of itself. The image in its entirety, however, is a different story. On one hand, I see a contradiction between the wholly inelegant, sterile, characterless, utilitarian desing of the van and the painting into which one assumes that a great deal of passion, care, love (or hate, or both, as the case may be) and self, not to mention a lot of hard work, was poured. This, for some reason, immediately reminds me of what Wilde once said about making a useful thing being forgivable as long as the maker does not admire it and the only excuse for making a useless thing being that the maker admires it intensely...And then on the other hand, we have curious parallels between the positions of the two men''s bodies, and between the open door of the truck and the woman on whose lap the man rests his head. I''d rather go no further than having noted these on a solely visual level, and leave the momentarily fun and exciting yet ultimately useless intellectual exercise of trying to find profound meanings and messages to others. I''d just like to say that rarely do I find myself wanting to look at an image for longer than 5 seconds (Regardless of how scintillating an image the photographer thinks it is) and even more rarely (more like "hardly ever"), being inspired to write a longer-than-five-words comment like this...10', '2008-10-29 23:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
