(5032432, 733381, 58272, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast here, both in terms of the story-telling aspect and the processing. Nice work!</td>', 'I like the contrast here, both in terms of the story-telling aspect and the processing. Nice work!', '2008-10-30 01:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032433, 733480, 58272, '<td valign="top">Nice acid tones.</td>', 'Nice acid tones.', '2008-10-30 01:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032480, 733508, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is sad and evocative.  Your title implies that his dear wife promised to stay with him but is no longer around.  Your picture shows a man either sad or tired, possibly both.  And it reminds us that time is an evil master.  The partial desat to reduce color here is very appropriate - everything fades with age.</td>', 'This is sad and evocative.  Your title implies that his dear wife promised to stay with him but is no longer around.  Your picture shows a man either sad or tired, possibly both.  And it reminds us that time is an evil master.  The partial desat to reduce color here is very appropriate - everything fades with age.', '2008-10-30 03:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032484, 733298, 30982, '<td valign="top">She''s impossibly slender - a lovely tall drink of water.  I want to reach out and slap her for smoking, too - it''ll rob her of her looks all too soon!  I like her faraway look - and the color definitely works in this one, as per your title.</td>', 'She''s impossibly slender - a lovely tall drink of water.  I want to reach out and slap her for smoking, too - it''ll rob her of her looks all too soon!  I like her faraway look - and the color definitely works in this one, as per your title.', '2008-10-30 03:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032487, 733492, 30982, '<td valign="top">A simple shot as your title implies - down to earth and real.  One almost wants to see more of her expression but really, his expression - very rapt and attentive - is a nice reflection of hers in a way.  Now if we could only convince our random targets on the street to not wear silly t-shirts.  :-)  This is a good catch.</td>', 'A simple shot as your title implies - down to earth and real.  One almost wants to see more of her expression but really, his expression - very rapt and attentive - is a nice reflection of hers in a way.  Now if we could only convince our random targets on the street to not wear silly t-shirts.  :-)  This is a good catch.', '2008-10-30 03:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032491, 733505, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is just plain fun!  Not your average wedding shot.  I love the wee bits of non-wedding party spectators in the background, wondering if you''ve all lost your minds, I''m sure.  Very nicely composed (though that darn streamer appears to be across the groom''s face, durnit) and just has a wonderful feel to it.</td>', 'This is just plain fun!  Not your average wedding shot.  I love the wee bits of non-wedding party spectators in the background, wondering if you''ve all lost your minds, I''m sure.  Very nicely composed (though that darn streamer appears to be across the groom''s face, durnit) and just has a wonderful feel to it.', '2008-10-30 03:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032493, 732647, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice artistic interpretation.  Almost wonder if this one, while quite good in B&amp;W, might work in color as well - I guess it depends on the colors on the mural behind him.  Good tonal range, very nice detail.</td>', 'A nice artistic interpretation.  Almost wonder if this one, while quite good in B&W, might work in color as well - I guess it depends on the colors on the mural behind him.  Good tonal range, very nice detail.', '2008-10-30 03:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032510, 733265, 60915, '<td valign="top">Hang on! is that <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=28742" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Art Roflmao</a><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=714857" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/120/714857.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/120/714857.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/25000-29999/28742/120/714857.jpg"/></a>on the right!!??<br/>Cool distortion! and an extra point for gettin <strike>Ken</strike> sorry, Mr R, in the shot! : )</td>', 'Hang on! is that  Art Roflmaoon the right!!??Cool distortion! and an extra point for gettin Ken sorry, Mr R, in the shot! : )', '2008-10-30 04:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032518, 733580, 97225, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo.</td>', 'Lovely photo.', '2008-10-30 04:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032530, 733887, 97225, '<td valign="top">I think this might have been better if the man hadn''t been there right behind the woman. He is a bit distracting. Otherwise it is a lovely shot.</td>', 'I think this might have been better if the man hadn''t been there right behind the woman. He is a bit distracting. Otherwise it is a lovely shot.', '2008-10-30 05:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032720, 733823, 4493, '<td valign="top">While it may not have been, this image looks a little bit contrived and planned. That being said, the post processing is great. I like the b/w conversion. I do think your shutter speed may have been just a little slow as the person is just a bit too blurred. Also, the area to the right of the image does not add to it. A square crop, cropping out the right 1/4 of the image will bring the viewers eyes to the subject on the left. As it is now, I drift off to the right and don''t return.</td>', 'While it may not have been, this image looks a little bit contrived and planned. That being said, the post processing is great. I like the b/w conversion. I do think your shutter speed may have been just a little slow as the person is just a bit too blurred. Also, the area to the right of the image does not add to it. A square crop, cropping out the right 1/4 of the image will bring the viewers eyes to the subject on the left. As it is now, I drift off to the right and don''t return.', '2008-10-30 10:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032736, 733871, 4493, '<td valign="top">Good capture and is very emotive. Only thing I would suggest is maybe boosting the contrast just a little.</td>', 'Good capture and is very emotive. Only thing I would suggest is maybe boosting the contrast just a little.', '2008-10-30 10:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032739, 733631, 4493, '<td valign="top">To the speed voter you''ll prolly get a low or average vote, but if the person spends any time appreciating the textures, lighting, and shadows along with the crop and post processing,they''ll realize that this is a very good image. I''m not usually a fan of centering the subject like you have, but with the environment they''re in, it works well.</td>', 'To the speed voter you''ll prolly get a low or average vote, but if the person spends any time appreciating the textures, lighting, and shadows along with the crop and post processing,they''ll realize that this is a very good image. I''m not usually a fan of centering the subject like you have, but with the environment they''re in, it works well.', '2008-10-30 10:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032748, 733650, 4493, '<td valign="top">This is probably an image that may have worked better in color. The muted b/w conversion as well as the centered subject and square crop leave the image a little lack luster.</td>', 'This is probably an image that may have worked better in color. The muted b/w conversion as well as the centered subject and square crop leave the image a little lack luster.', '2008-10-30 10:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032750, 733530, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the woman is doing, but the ship and kid in the background along with her standing in the mouth of the shark makes for a surreal image. This is interesting and the more one looks at it the more it feels like a painting that should be hanging in an art gallery. Wish her hand was down, but that''s not within your control while shooting the shot.</td>', 'Not sure what the woman is doing, but the ship and kid in the background along with her standing in the mouth of the shark makes for a surreal image. This is interesting and the more one looks at it the more it feels like a painting that should be hanging in an art gallery. Wish her hand was down, but that''s not within your control while shooting the shot.', '2008-10-30 10:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032757, 733508, 4493, '<td valign="top">Taken while you walked past? Overall the image doesn''t pull me in or relay a story. I see a man sitting on a bench and you walking past hoping to snap a pic without being seen. Engage the subject or change your position and it may have been a stronger shot.</td>', 'Taken while you walked past? Overall the image doesn''t pull me in or relay a story. I see a man sitting on a bench and you walking past hoping to snap a pic without being seen. Engage the subject or change your position and it may have been a stronger shot.', '2008-10-30 10:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032761, 733701, 4493, '<td valign="top">What do you want this image to tell the viewer? How does this engage us or make us spend more than 2 seconds voting on it? Is there something here that you see or feel that you want me to know or is this a picture that technically meets the challenge so you entered it? Yes the woman behind him has some interest with her head down and I can wonder what she may be thinking, but overall the image falls short of being meaningful to me.</td>', 'What do you want this image to tell the viewer? How does this engage us or make us spend more than 2 seconds voting on it? Is there something here that you see or feel that you want me to know or is this a picture that technically meets the challenge so you entered it? Yes the woman behind him has some interest with her head down and I can wonder what she may be thinking, but overall the image falls short of being meaningful to me.', '2008-10-30 10:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032768, 732927, 4493, '<td valign="top">Seems I''ve been commenting most about this... crop crop crop. I''m feeling a lot of people are afraid to crop out distractions from their image. First thing my eye goes to in your shot is the top of the shot where the signs are. Do we need these in order to feel the emotion toward the guy at the bottom. The two elements compete and I barely notice him down in the shadow.</td>', 'Seems I''ve been commenting most about this... crop crop crop. I''m feeling a lot of people are afraid to crop out distractions from their image. First thing my eye goes to in your shot is the top of the shot where the signs are. Do we need these in order to feel the emotion toward the guy at the bottom. The two elements compete and I barely notice him down in the shadow.', '2008-10-30 10:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032774, 733888, 4493, '<td valign="top">The black and white conversion doesn''t make this any more interesting than if it were in color. Looking through the challenge and comparing this to other street photography, this feels like it''s just a snapshot you took during the week and submitted. I don''t feel anything in this shot other than the subject looks kind of like Willy Nelson.</td>', 'The black and white conversion doesn''t make this any more interesting than if it were in color. Looking through the challenge and comparing this to other street photography, this feels like it''s just a snapshot you took during the week and submitted. I don''t feel anything in this shot other than the subject looks kind of like Willy Nelson.', '2008-10-30 10:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032777, 733351, 4493, '<td valign="top">What keeps this from being a 10 from me is that the man is tucked into the truck... had we seen him looking at the shot or walking to or from the truck he''d have added that last little bit of umph you''d need to push this into 10 catagory. Not sure why this image is on the wall but it''s a great find with good post processing.</td>', 'What keeps this from being a 10 from me is that the man is tucked into the truck... had we seen him looking at the shot or walking to or from the truck he''d have added that last little bit of umph you''d need to push this into 10 catagory. Not sure why this image is on the wall but it''s a great find with good post processing.', '2008-10-30 10:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032787, 733465, 6999, '<td valign="top">Well, I guess it is at least shot on the street; although of course the posed shot, and the overly portentous subject are probably too much of a push for the genre really.</td>', 'Well, I guess it is at least shot on the street; although of course the posed shot, and the overly portentous subject are probably too much of a push for the genre really.', '2008-10-30 11:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032824, 733373, 62318, '<td valign="top">Good context with the environment here. I really like how his shirt says Canada, but everything is in Italian. Makes for a good mix of the senses.   At the same time I am a little lost with this photo. Is the guy the vendor or is he waiting (rest comment got cut off...) as a customer? I''m guessing from the shirt he is customer. Beyond that the photo is really well done. The composition overall works and there is alot of interest throughout the frame. Highly rated.</td>', 'Good context with the environment here. I really like how his shirt says Canada, but everything is in Italian. Makes for a good mix of the senses.   At the same time I am a little lost with this photo. Is the guy the vendor or is he waiting (rest comment got cut off...) as a customer? I''m guessing from the shirt he is customer. Beyond that the photo is really well done. The composition overall works and there is alot of interest throughout the frame. Highly rated.', '2008-10-30 11:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032836, 732711, 62318, '<td valign="top">This is a good PJ piece. I really like the composition and how the lady is reach out of the frame, it gives it some depth. I think the photo would have been better without the two in the background as it gives more relation to the sign. Probably need to be shot more more stop down for good focus on the lady, but a minor point. Good contrast and color. (Not sure I understand the border). Overall I think this is a good documentary style piece and highly rated.</td>', 'This is a good PJ piece. I really like the composition and how the lady is reach out of the frame, it gives it some depth. I think the photo would have been better without the two in the background as it gives more relation to the sign. Probably need to be shot more more stop down for good focus on the lady, but a minor point. Good contrast and color. (Not sure I understand the border). Overall I think this is a good documentary style piece and highly rated.', '2008-10-30 11:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032851, 733149, 62318, '<td valign="top">Wonderful abstract on lines and form. Love how the individual is in the light which really makes the composition special. Only quibble would be to use distortion control to fix the slight barrel distortion. Normally not a big deal, but a little noticeable here with the emphasis on lines. Very cool photo and highly rated.</td>', 'Wonderful abstract on lines and form. Love how the individual is in the light which really makes the composition special. Only quibble would be to use distortion control to fix the slight barrel distortion. Normally not a big deal, but a little noticeable here with the emphasis on lines. Very cool photo and highly rated.', '2008-10-30 11:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032853, 733379, 84779, '<td valign="top">really cool shot</td>', 'really cool shot', '2008-10-30 11:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032864, 733802, 30982, '<td valign="top">I do quite like the quietness of this.  Really looks to be a lovely place to sit and relax.</td>', 'I do quite like the quietness of this.  Really looks to be a lovely place to sit and relax.', '2008-10-30 12:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032866, 733856, 30982, '<td valign="top">An interesting home to be sure and he seems to have it quite well organized.  I suspect from the tree trunks beyond this is a relatively warm climate, which is a good place to have a home such as this.</td>', 'An interesting home to be sure and he seems to have it quite well organized.  I suspect from the tree trunks beyond this is a relatively warm climate, which is a good place to have a home such as this.', '2008-10-30 12:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032882, 733617, 62318, '<td valign="top">There a lot of things that I really liked about this photo. The nice lines that run from the front of the frame towards the back, the repetition of the window sills, the slight difference in the couple and the long photographer in the background. Good stuff overall. My only minor suggestion might be to try to bring that man hole cover out a bit, it might add some additional interest to that area of the frame. Then again maybe not. Wonderful shot overall and highly rated.</td>', 'There a lot of things that I really liked about this photo. The nice lines that run from the front of the frame towards the back, the repetition of the window sills, the slight difference in the couple and the long photographer in the background. Good stuff overall. My only minor suggestion might be to try to bring that man hole cover out a bit, it might add some additional interest to that area of the frame. Then again maybe not. Wonderful shot overall and highly rated.', '2008-10-30 12:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5032904, 733560, 62318, '<td valign="top">Really love the limited color palette here as well as the nice vertical lines. Wonderful contrast and good post processing.  However, for me personally that is something about the photo that feels slight boring. I think for me it is just the subject matter (too static). Everything else is spot on and still a great shot. Highly rated.</td>', 'Really love the limited color palette here as well as the nice vertical lines. Wonderful contrast and good post processing.  However, for me personally that is something about the photo that feels slight boring. I think for me it is just the subject matter (too static). Everything else is spot on and still a great shot. Highly rated.', '2008-10-30 12:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033021, 733910, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a good street shot, in my opinion.  You''ve got a lot of interesting characters, a good setting, a bit of a story going on.  There''s even lunch sitting on the bench, apparently forgotten because the game takes precedence.  And at least one person appears to have caught you.  :-)</td>', 'This is a good street shot, in my opinion.  You''ve got a lot of interesting characters, a good setting, a bit of a story going on.  There''s even lunch sitting on the bench, apparently forgotten because the game takes precedence.  And at least one person appears to have caught you.  :-)', '2008-10-30 14:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033028, 733149, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  Quiet, but very expressive.  The grandeur of the frame, the lovely lines of the structure, particularly the three strong horizontals from right to left echoed so nicely with the horizontal between the tree and person.  And the tree - acting to me as a guardian to the scene, a witness, if you will.  The person will walk on, but the tree will stay and keep record.</td>', 'Very cool shot.  Quiet, but very expressive.  The grandeur of the frame, the lovely lines of the structure, particularly the three strong horizontals from right to left echoed so nicely with the horizontal between the tree and person.  And the tree - acting to me as a guardian to the scene, a witness, if you will.  The person will walk on, but the tree will stay and keep record.', '2008-10-30 14:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033032, 733636, 30982, '<td valign="top">My very first impression was "Cool!  Poster!"  Next was "not sure about the processing" but I''ve come to think the processing is just what is needed here.  The person, the Human, is almost a caricature, almost not quite real, but still quite real.  So intense, and so utterly unaware of the perfect picture he creates underneath the sign.  Great catch.</td>', 'My very first impression was "Cool!  Poster!"  Next was "not sure about the processing" but I''ve come to think the processing is just what is needed here.  The person, the Human, is almost a caricature, almost not quite real, but still quite real.  So intense, and so utterly unaware of the perfect picture he creates underneath the sign.  Great catch.', '2008-10-30 14:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033037, 733822, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love how small and insignificant the hitchhiker is.  Also really like the glow of the lights.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I love how small and insignificant the hitchhiker is.  Also really like the glow of the lights.  Nicely done.', '2008-10-30 14:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033039, 733904, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very good street portrait - nice detail, great light, and a cool environment to present him in.</td>', 'A very good street portrait - nice detail, great light, and a cool environment to present him in.', '2008-10-30 14:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033041, 733823, 30982, '<td valign="top">Dark, foreboding, and the blurred person seems almost a threat to the one sitting - a sense of apprehension, of fear.</td>', 'Dark, foreboding, and the blurred person seems almost a threat to the one sitting - a sense of apprehension, of fear.', '2008-10-30 14:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033043, 733642, 30982, '<td valign="top">This shows very well in this challenge - hope it''s doing OK for you!  (Comment only.)</td>', 'This shows very well in this challenge - hope it''s doing OK for you!  (Comment only.)', '2008-10-30 14:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033046, 733438, 30982, '<td valign="top">I really do love the effect of an overlay without the overlay.  To me there''s just enough light on her face to show she''s a beautiful girl, but to not show you clearly who she is - just a glimpse is all.  (Comment only.)</td>', 'I really do love the effect of an overlay without the overlay.  To me there''s just enough light on her face to show she''s a beautiful girl, but to not show you clearly who she is - just a glimpse is all.  (Comment only.)', '2008-10-30 14:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033048, 733572, 30982, '<td valign="top">An excellent job isolating your subject in an otherwise busy scene, both by your focus, and by the look you caught which in turn catches our attention.  I''d love to see more of that structure across the way - looks like a sculpture of some kind?  (Not particularly for this picture, though - just that it looks like a nifty structure.)</td>', 'An excellent job isolating your subject in an otherwise busy scene, both by your focus, and by the look you caught which in turn catches our attention.  I''d love to see more of that structure across the way - looks like a sculpture of some kind?  (Not particularly for this picture, though - just that it looks like a nifty structure.)', '2008-10-30 14:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033051, 733585, 30982, '<td valign="top">Everyone seems so disaffected, so dismal.  Even the guy hoding the megaphone looks as though it''s a burden.  Dark, dreary, very effective.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Everyone seems so disaffected, so dismal.  Even the guy hoding the megaphone looks as though it''s a burden.  Dark, dreary, very effective.  Nicely done.', '2008-10-30 14:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033053, 733876, 30982, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice to keep the color on the walls/window, yet remove it from your subject.  Not something I''d normally like, I don''t think, but it does seem to work here.  Reminds me of days we''d sit on my grandparents'' porch and cut beans or shell peas.</td>', 'Interesting choice to keep the color on the walls/window, yet remove it from your subject.  Not something I''d normally like, I don''t think, but it does seem to work here.  Reminds me of days we''d sit on my grandparents'' porch and cut beans or shell peas.', '2008-10-30 14:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033054, 733801, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, great perspective, nice energy to this.  I suspect this will be in the top ten at a minimum.</td>', 'Very colorful, great perspective, nice energy to this.  I suspect this will be in the top ten at a minimum.', '2008-10-30 14:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033062, 733704, 30982, '<td valign="top">This one struck me right away.  Your title adds, but the picture really does carry on its own just fine.  I do like the composition - not just for the words in the window, but the cartoon dolls as well.  Really a nice shot, nice processing to support it as well.</td>', 'This one struck me right away.  Your title adds, but the picture really does carry on its own just fine.  I do like the composition - not just for the words in the window, but the cartoon dolls as well.  Really a nice shot, nice processing to support it as well.', '2008-10-30 14:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033065, 733613, 30982, '<td valign="top">Now that''s what I call posing for the camera!  I like the rather bemused McCain supporter behind as well.  Nice energy to this.</td>', 'Now that''s what I call posing for the camera!  I like the rather bemused McCain supporter behind as well.  Nice energy to this.', '2008-10-30 14:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033067, 733824, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is just odd enough that I really like it.  Not exactly sure why, but I really like it.</td>', 'This is just odd enough that I really like it.  Not exactly sure why, but I really like it.', '2008-10-30 14:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033071, 733635, 30982, '<td valign="top">The obvious goodliness - the guy walking with the cigarette, the bitchin'' and lovely vehicle.  The less obvious and more interesting - the head at the top of the car and the tie to the right of the head.</td>', 'The obvious goodliness - the guy walking with the cigarette, the bitchin'' and lovely vehicle.  The less obvious and more interesting - the head at the top of the car and the tie to the right of the head.', '2008-10-30 14:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033074, 733813, 30982, '<td valign="top">Really nice use of lines here - the structure, both vertical, horizontal, and reflected, and a plaid umbrella to boot.  Add to that animal prints - her scarf and footwear, and it''s a lovely jumble of clashes!</td>', 'Really nice use of lines here - the structure, both vertical, horizontal, and reflected, and a plaid umbrella to boot.  Add to that animal prints - her scarf and footwear, and it''s a lovely jumble of clashes!', '2008-10-30 14:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033078, 733463, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very much my kind of shot - neat stuff to see everywhere.  A couple, a sailboat, someone wading, a pelican (yay!), a motor boat, and trees.  All grounded by a bench.  Has the lovely feel of a late summer afternoon - relaxed, warm, and carefree.</td>', 'Very much my kind of shot - neat stuff to see everywhere.  A couple, a sailboat, someone wading, a pelican (yay!), a motor boat, and trees.  All grounded by a bench.  Has the lovely feel of a late summer afternoon - relaxed, warm, and carefree.', '2008-10-30 14:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033193, 733912, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot, nicely composed.  Gives us a glimpse, in a way, of what this little girl sees of the world around her.  I like the way mom is reaching back around her, providing that little bit extra of support.</td>', 'Sweet shot, nicely composed.  Gives us a glimpse, in a way, of what this little girl sees of the world around her.  I like the way mom is reaching back around her, providing that little bit extra of support.', '2008-10-30 15:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033196, 733388, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite love the balance and warmth of this.  Beautifully captured and presented.</td>', 'I quite love the balance and warmth of this.  Beautifully captured and presented.', '2008-10-30 15:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033197, 732711, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a very fun, very energetic, very interesting shot.  Sure, just people, but what vibrant people!  Nicely done.  And a nifty border with the negative image thing going on.</td>', 'This is a very fun, very energetic, very interesting shot.  Sure, just people, but what vibrant people!  Nicely done.  And a nifty border with the negative image thing going on.', '2008-10-30 15:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033200, 733486, 30982, '<td valign="top">You simply can''t ask for better light, or a better backdrop.  Very well seen, well timed, well presented.</td>', 'You simply can''t ask for better light, or a better backdrop.  Very well seen, well timed, well presented.', '2008-10-30 15:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033201, 733918, 30982, '<td valign="top">Probably not everyone''s idea of street - more of a candid - but this works for me.  It has the quiet of a place just off the street, perhaps, where one can collect one''s thoughts.  Lovely light here, very nicely composed.</td>', 'Probably not everyone''s idea of street - more of a candid - but this works for me.  It has the quiet of a place just off the street, perhaps, where one can collect one''s thoughts.  Lovely light here, very nicely composed.', '2008-10-30 15:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033204, 733421, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of a vibrant background and I do like that the people in front are in silhouette.</td>', 'Very effective use of a vibrant background and I do like that the people in front are in silhouette.', '2008-10-30 15:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033206, 733435, 30982, '<td valign="top">As you may or may not know, I''m a fan of pigeons and other city birds.  I love where you caught the in-flight one in the frame and the fact you didn''t crop out the other one at the top.  I like your title as well - suits this nicely.</td>', 'As you may or may not know, I''m a fan of pigeons and other city birds.  I love where you caught the in-flight one in the frame and the fact you didn''t crop out the other one at the top.  I like your title as well - suits this nicely.', '2008-10-30 15:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033210, 733515, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is just too cool for school, or whatever the saying is these days.  You just have to wonder what comes next. Catching the others watching is icing on the cake.</td>', 'This is just too cool for school, or whatever the saying is these days.  You just have to wonder what comes next. Catching the others watching is icing on the cake.', '2008-10-30 15:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033212, 733821, 30982, '<td valign="top">Some will consider this a bit of a copout - ie shooting people from behind - but their body language and the color of this shot, along with the railing and path to draw you in, makes for a very pleasing photograph.  Light is gorgeous and handled well.</td>', 'Some will consider this a bit of a copout - ie shooting people from behind - but their body language and the color of this shot, along with the railing and path to draw you in, makes for a very pleasing photograph.  Light is gorgeous and handled well.', '2008-10-30 15:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033213, 733631, 30982, '<td valign="top">I don''t get "wasted" from this - I get the perplexing, frustrating, "why me?" teenage angst from this.  While it may have been posed, it doesn''t feel like it - feels like a stolen moment.  Nice work with the light, too.</td>', 'I don''t get "wasted" from this - I get the perplexing, frustrating, "why me?" teenage angst from this.  While it may have been posed, it doesn''t feel like it - feels like a stolen moment.  Nice work with the light, too.', '2008-10-30 15:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033216, 733697, 30982, '<td valign="top">What I really like about this is that everyone seems to be truly enjoying themselves.  Makes me wonder where this is where grocery shopping is so delightfuly fun.  A great catch - great moment in time.</td>', 'What I really like about this is that everyone seems to be truly enjoying themselves.  Makes me wonder where this is where grocery shopping is so delightfuly fun.  A great catch - great moment in time.', '2008-10-30 15:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033236, 733351, 30982, '<td valign="top">Mr Clarke, I presume.  I so want to know the story of the painting/picture on the wall, and why Dan felt he had to add his bit to it.</td>', 'Mr Clarke, I presume.  I so want to know the story of the painting/picture on the wall, and why Dan felt he had to add his bit to it.', '2008-10-30 16:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033237, 733907, 30982, '<td valign="top">This has a marvelous sense of life, of enjoyment, of energy.  The two dancers seem completely intent on their dance - in their own little world.</td>', 'This has a marvelous sense of life, of enjoyment, of energy.  The two dancers seem completely intent on their dance - in their own little world.', '2008-10-30 16:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033240, 733373, 30982, '<td valign="top">What I enjoy most about this - everything is in Italian (I think) yet the gentleman, who I assume is the proprietor of this colorful stand, is wearing a shirt that says Canada.  A colorful, entertaining, and quirky shot.</td>', 'What I enjoy most about this - everything is in Italian (I think) yet the gentleman, who I assume is the proprietor of this colorful stand, is wearing a shirt that says Canada.  A colorful, entertaining, and quirky shot.', '2008-10-30 16:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033242, 733561, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture of both street activities and a street "feel".  Not to mention very good timing and placement of your subjects in the frame.  The whole lensbaby-type thing works for this, too.  Would be a nice shot without the foreground subject, but is a way better shot with him and his bike.</td>', 'Excellent capture of both street activities and a street "feel".  Not to mention very good timing and placement of your subjects in the frame.  The whole lensbaby-type thing works for this, too.  Would be a nice shot without the foreground subject, but is a way better shot with him and his bike.', '2008-10-30 16:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033243, 733094, 30982, '<td valign="top">Fun!  Not only does it make me smile along with them, but I wonder what it is they find so amusing.  Works for me.</td>', 'Fun!  Not only does it make me smile along with them, but I wonder what it is they find so amusing.  Works for me.', '2008-10-30 16:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033244, 733380, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Cute!  They really do look like long lost relatives.  Your toning suits this well, too.</td>', 'Heh!  Cute!  They really do look like long lost relatives.  Your toning suits this well, too.', '2008-10-30 16:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033246, 733379, 30982, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Definitely makes me smile!  The posture of the bird is wonderful and I love the setting - a funky kind of scene in a funky kind of place.</td>', 'LOL!  Definitely makes me smile!  The posture of the bird is wonderful and I love the setting - a funky kind of scene in a funky kind of place.', '2008-10-30 16:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033247, 733718, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like all the elements you''ve managed to include - the pedestrians, the police car (I''m assuming), the city environment.  Yet your subject is very nicely isolated and presented by his position in the frame and the clarity.  Nicely done street/environmental portrait.</td>', 'I like all the elements you''ve managed to include - the pedestrians, the police car (I''m assuming), the city environment.  Yet your subject is very nicely isolated and presented by his position in the frame and the clarity.  Nicely done street/environmental portrait.', '2008-10-30 16:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033249, 733402, 30982, '<td valign="top">The gentleman''s smile back to the boy is what wins here.  I understand why you chose to use selective desat here - to have him stand out in his environment and add the interaction with the boy.  But I suspect it may have worked based on his smile alone in pure B&amp;W as well.  Very clean work with the desat by the way.</td>', 'The gentleman''s smile back to the boy is what wins here.  I understand why you chose to use selective desat here - to have him stand out in his environment and add the interaction with the boy.  But I suspect it may have worked based on his smile alone in pure B&W as well.  Very clean work with the desat by the way.', '2008-10-30 16:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033250, 733444, 30982, '<td valign="top">I would hope with you this close that this was a training exercise and that you and your camera weren''t in danger of flying bricks!  Excellent constrast and detail in this conversion.</td>', 'I would hope with you this close that this was a training exercise and that you and your camera weren''t in danger of flying bricks!  Excellent constrast and detail in this conversion.', '2008-10-30 16:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033251, 732863, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is quite simply bitchin'' way cool.  Art as a street shot.  Or a street shot as art.  Either way, it works.</td>', 'This is quite simply bitchin'' way cool.  Art as a street shot.  Or a street shot as art.  Either way, it works.', '2008-10-30 16:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033252, 733381, 30982, '<td valign="top">Absolutely perfect for this challenge and an awesome photograph on its own right.  So many stories here.  The main story of the gentleman on the bench, aside from the others, in a B&amp;W tone different than the rest (nice touch, that.)  The light on him, whether actual or slightly enchanced, is very nice.  Then there''s the rest of the story at the top of the steps.  Congratulations on a wonderful find and taking full advantage of it.</td>', 'Absolutely perfect for this challenge and an awesome photograph on its own right.  So many stories here.  The main story of the gentleman on the bench, aside from the others, in a B&W tone different than the rest (nice touch, that.)  The light on him, whether actual or slightly enchanced, is very nice.  Then there''s the rest of the story at the top of the steps.  Congratulations on a wonderful find and taking full advantage of it.', '2008-10-30 16:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033468, 733435, 1024, '<td valign="top">The timing on this shot is absolutely perfect!   You could not have set this up as well if you were trying to.  Wonderful example of a street photograph.</td>', 'The timing on this shot is absolutely perfect!   You could not have set this up as well if you were trying to.  Wonderful example of a street photograph.', '2008-10-30 18:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033470, 733465, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible, dark moody shot.  Very well done.</td>', 'This is an incredible, dark moody shot.  Very well done.', '2008-10-30 18:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033471, 733871, 1024, '<td valign="top">So much character in those eyes.  I bet he has some stories to tell.</td>', 'So much character in those eyes.  I bet he has some stories to tell.', '2008-10-30 18:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033476, 733363, 1024, '<td valign="top">Wow, so emotional!  Love the contrast between the man and the innocence of the kitten.</td>', 'Wow, so emotional!  Love the contrast between the man and the innocence of the kitten.', '2008-10-30 18:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033478, 733298, 1024, '<td valign="top">The bright garish colors absolutely make this image.  So glad you did not change it to black and white (like so many others have done).</td>', 'The bright garish colors absolutely make this image.  So glad you did not change it to black and white (like so many others have done).', '2008-10-30 18:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5033551, 732507, 26464, '<td valign="top">definitely one of the characters of that area.</td>', 'definitely one of the characters of that area.', '2008-10-30 19:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
