(5034076, 733886, 88523, '<td valign="top">Now that is a nice set of white, hair. This man puts out a feeling of strength which you''ve captured.   I think I would have preferred him placed either dead centre or more off to the sides...</td>', 'Now that is a nice set of white, hair. This man puts out a feeling of strength which you''ve captured.   I think I would have preferred him placed either dead centre or more off to the sides...', '2008-10-31 08:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034095, 733822, 88523, '<td valign="top">Very cool...reminds me of ''Lost Highway''.</td>', 'Very cool...reminds me of ''Lost Highway''.', '2008-10-31 08:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034097, 733918, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp candid with good DOF... The right side of the pic loses my interest a bit.</td>', 'Nice crisp candid with good DOF... The right side of the pic loses my interest a bit.', '2008-10-31 08:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034103, 732863, 88523, '<td valign="top">This is awesome...the angles and tones of the frame really are something... the hunch figure is mirroring the posture of the man in the distance and alluding to the fact that time does not bode well for him (that''s how I see it anyway). Also, the man is far off and small, but you just can''t miss him. 10</td>', 'This is awesome...the angles and tones of the frame really are something... the hunch figure is mirroring the posture of the man in the distance and alluding to the fact that time does not bode well for him (that''s how I see it anyway). Also, the man is far off and small, but you just can''t miss him. 10', '2008-10-31 08:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034104, 733062, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice...I like the peeping sun, colours and the way my eye seamlessly explores everything...I would perhaps try chopping a bit off the top...maybe.</td>', 'Nice...I like the peeping sun, colours and the way my eye seamlessly explores everything...I would perhaps try chopping a bit off the top...maybe.', '2008-10-31 09:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034107, 733888, 88523, '<td valign="top">The man makes a good subject as does the demon skull.  Perhaps in need of more depth through contrast?</td>', 'The man makes a good subject as does the demon skull.  Perhaps in need of more depth through contrast?', '2008-10-31 09:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034111, 733907, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice street scene and moment. Having a bit of trouble separating them form the background.</td>', 'Nice street scene and moment. Having a bit of trouble separating them form the background.', '2008-10-31 09:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034137, 733715, 98986, '<td valign="top">that looks pretty cool</td>', 'that looks pretty cool', '2008-10-31 09:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034157, 733265, 75713, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment only:<br/> <br/>I like your pp on this shot..the cigarette butts on the ground, the expression on the woman''s face, the way people give her a wide berth, all contribute to the story I make up in my mind as to what is going on. Nice job</td>', 'Coming back to comment only: I like your pp on this shot..the cigarette butts on the ground, the expression on the woman''s face, the way people give her a wide berth, all contribute to the story I make up in my mind as to what is going on. Nice job', '2008-10-31 09:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034164, 732507, 75713, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment only:<br/> <br/>In my opinion, the fact that you were caught out taking the photo adds to it.. the expression in the face, the catch light in the eyes, the abundant lipstick would have been lost and they are the story really... she looks weary.. a hard life I think.. I used to live in TO, know Queen street.. a play on words?  very well done.</td>', 'Coming back to comment only: In my opinion, the fact that you were caught out taking the photo adds to it.. the expression in the face, the catch light in the eyes, the abundant lipstick would have been lost and they are the story really... she looks weary.. a hard life I think.. I used to live in TO, know Queen street.. a play on words?  very well done.', '2008-10-31 09:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034176, 733381, 39880, '<td valign="top">This is my top pick.  I just like how everyone is having fun, and here is this guy, on the outside, counting his money as if checking that he has enough to get in.  This tells a nice story.</td>', 'This is my top pick.  I just like how everyone is having fun, and here is this guy, on the outside, counting his money as if checking that he has enough to get in.  This tells a nice story.', '2008-10-31 10:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034177, 733381, 88523, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast, bravo.</td>', 'Very nice contrast, bravo.', '2008-10-31 10:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034179, 733486, 39880, '<td valign="top">Something about the light in this and the painted stars, on the wall, along with the painted kids watching, all make this a very interesting picture.</td>', 'Something about the light in this and the painted stars, on the wall, along with the painted kids watching, all make this a very interesting picture.', '2008-10-31 10:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034181, 733801, 39880, '<td valign="top">Great colors.  I see a lot of attitude in this.</td>', 'Great colors.  I see a lot of attitude in this.', '2008-10-31 10:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034182, 733738, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice work.  I like the perspective.</td>', 'Nice work.  I like the perspective.', '2008-10-31 10:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034183, 733388, 88523, '<td valign="top">This rocks... Great light in this. The distance separating the two men is greater than that between them.  ...The wall fixture, the couple behind as a contrast, the bicycle coming out from within the shadows... Bravo bravo!</td>', 'This rocks... Great light in this. The distance separating the two men is greater than that between them.  ...The wall fixture, the couple behind as a contrast, the bicycle coming out from within the shadows... Bravo bravo!', '2008-10-31 10:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034185, 733298, 39880, '<td valign="top">The colors really make this stand out.  And the good looking girl doesn''t hurt.</td>', 'The colors really make this stand out.  And the good looking girl doesn''t hurt.', '2008-10-31 10:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034186, 733794, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and framing... great ion BW...the guy in the hoodie works very well...</td>', 'Nice perspective and framing... great ion BW...the guy in the hoodie works very well...', '2008-10-31 10:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034187, 733894, 39880, '<td valign="top">I''m not really getting a sense of ''street photography'' here.  I think if would work better if you pulled back and had him and surroundings in the frame.</td>', 'I''m not really getting a sense of ''street photography'' here.  I think if would work better if you pulled back and had him and surroundings in the frame.', '2008-10-31 10:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034188, 733790, 39880, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but not really getting a ''street photography'' feeling.</td>', 'Nice shot, but not really getting a ''street photography'' feeling.', '2008-10-31 10:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034189, 733351, 88523, '<td valign="top">Very nice setting...The painting serves as a strong reminder that sometimes life just isn''t as dramatic as we depict it.</td>', 'Very nice setting...The painting serves as a strong reminder that sometimes life just isn''t as dramatic as we depict it.', '2008-10-31 10:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034190, 733580, 39880, '<td valign="top">The image looks a bit distorted.  Otherwise a nice candid.</td>', 'The image looks a bit distorted.  Otherwise a nice candid.', '2008-10-31 10:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034191, 732646, 88523, '<td valign="top">Great barber stand!</td>', 'Great barber stand!', '2008-10-31 10:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034195, 733898, 88523, '<td valign="top">Very cool scene....</td>', 'Very cool scene....', '2008-10-31 10:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034197, 733823, 88523, '<td valign="top">Very nice setting and shutter speed.  A bit dark?</td>', 'Very nice setting and shutter speed.  A bit dark?', '2008-10-31 10:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034215, 733801, 61222, '<td valign="top">I love this one. Great job love the colors.</td>', 'I love this one. Great job love the colors.', '2008-10-31 10:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034237, 733801, 70265, '<td valign="top">I really really like this. You''ve captured a grungy street feel whilst still using bright colors &amp; sharpness. the composition is right on, I love how his body is positioned in the frame, with a spray can in each hand and the graffiti framing his head. my blue ribbon pick. 10</td>', 'I really really like this. You''ve captured a grungy street feel whilst still using bright colors & sharpness. the composition is right on, I love how his body is positioned in the frame, with a spray can in each hand and the graffiti framing his head. my blue ribbon pick. 10', '2008-10-31 10:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034238, 733636, 70265, '<td valign="top">i love the way he looks like he''s in a glass cage, ready to be studied. This is an awesome entry. 10</td>', 'i love the way he looks like he''s in a glass cage, ready to be studied. This is an awesome entry. 10', '2008-10-31 10:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034239, 733561, 70265, '<td valign="top">I love the way you''ve framed the skateboarder under the lettering. Very nice choice of coloring, and the composition works very well imo. One of my favs in this challenge. 9</td>', 'I love the way you''ve framed the skateboarder under the lettering. Very nice choice of coloring, and the composition works very well imo. One of my favs in this challenge. 9', '2008-10-31 10:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034240, 733480, 70265, '<td valign="top">love it</td>', 'love it', '2008-10-31 10:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034242, 732866, 70265, '<td valign="top">i like how the dark feel still comes through the soft processing. Sepia works well here. One of my top picks 9</td>', 'i like how the dark feel still comes through the soft processing. Sepia works well here. One of my top picks 9', '2008-10-31 10:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034245, 733381, 70265, '<td valign="top">great example of rule of thirds, tells an interesting story. B&amp;W works well here. 8</td>', 'great example of rule of thirds, tells an interesting story. B&W works well here. 8', '2008-10-31 10:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034246, 733486, 70265, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity &amp; lighting on this. Stopped motion is awesome. Your choice of tones work well. I may have cropped off the top white strip, but that''s just me ... 8</td>', 'I love the clarity & lighting on this. Stopped motion is awesome. Your choice of tones work well. I may have cropped off the top white strip, but that''s just me ... 8', '2008-10-31 10:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034247, 733465, 70265, '<td valign="top">very effective, on many levels. 8 from me.</td>', 'very effective, on many levels. 8 from me.', '2008-10-31 10:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034248, 732647, 70265, '<td valign="top">I like your subject. At first I wished he popped off the background a bit more. On second thought, it makes sense that a person such as he blends into his environment, becoming invisible to the rest of us ... 8</td>', 'I like your subject. At first I wished he popped off the background a bit more. On second thought, it makes sense that a person such as he blends into his environment, becoming invisible to the rest of us ... 8', '2008-10-31 10:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034249, 733871, 70265, '<td valign="top">emotive portrait. Hard to look at, but a great capture nonetheless. 8</td>', 'emotive portrait. Hard to look at, but a great capture nonetheless. 8', '2008-10-31 10:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034250, 733560, 70265, '<td valign="top">Yes, I like the way the blue tones emphasize the cold feel of being alone. Effective composition and placement of subject. Very nice work.</td>', 'Yes, I like the way the blue tones emphasize the cold feel of being alone. Effective composition and placement of subject. Very nice work.', '2008-10-31 10:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034251, 733373, 70265, '<td valign="top">Effective use of selective desaturation.</td>', 'Effective use of selective desaturation.', '2008-10-31 10:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034252, 733631, 70265, '<td valign="top">great use of DOF. LOve the square crop too. 8</td>', 'great use of DOF. LOve the square crop too. 8', '2008-10-31 10:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034253, 733896, 70265, '<td valign="top">he looks like he''s just watching the world go by ... nice image.</td>', 'he looks like he''s just watching the world go by ... nice image.', '2008-10-31 10:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034256, 733265, 70265, '<td valign="top">Your choice of lens creates a movement around the main subject that is very effective I think. 8</td>', 'Your choice of lens creates a movement around the main subject that is very effective I think. 8', '2008-10-31 10:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034257, 733438, 70265, '<td valign="top">the graininess works well here, and the dirty window adds to the feelings expressed in your title. nice work 8</td>', 'the graininess works well here, and the dirty window adds to the feelings expressed in your title. nice work 8', '2008-10-31 10:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034258, 733617, 70265, '<td valign="top">nicely seen &amp; captured.</td>', 'nicely seen & captured.', '2008-10-31 10:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034259, 733330, 70265, '<td valign="top">nice DOF</td>', 'nice DOF', '2008-10-31 10:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034260, 733388, 70265, '<td valign="top">makes me wonder what they''re looking at</td>', 'makes me wonder what they''re looking at', '2008-10-31 10:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034261, 733194, 70265, '<td valign="top">like the way it looks like it was shot from the hip ...</td>', 'like the way it looks like it was shot from the hip ...', '2008-10-31 10:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034262, 733298, 70265, '<td valign="top">great colors</td>', 'great colors', '2008-10-31 10:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034264, 733695, 70265, '<td valign="top">like the leading lines as well as the color here.</td>', 'like the leading lines as well as the color here.', '2008-10-31 10:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034267, 732913, 70265, '<td valign="top">he has a very interesting face.</td>', 'he has a very interesting face.', '2008-10-31 10:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034268, 733530, 70265, '<td valign="top">this is quite interesting to look at. Not sure why the black on the left, but it seems to work.</td>', 'this is quite interesting to look at. Not sure why the black on the left, but it seems to work.', '2008-10-31 10:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034270, 733380, 70265, '<td valign="top">like your post processing</td>', 'like your post processing', '2008-10-31 10:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034272, 733823, 70265, '<td valign="top">nice. wondering what the color version looked like</td>', 'nice. wondering what the color version looked like', '2008-10-31 10:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034277, 733340, 70265, '<td valign="top">interesting street portrait</td>', 'interesting street portrait', '2008-10-31 10:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034299, 733821, 100069, '<td valign="top">Love the title. It really makes you see the picture in a different way..</td>', 'Love the title. It really makes you see the picture in a different way..', '2008-10-31 11:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034312, 733571, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the natural ease in which this photo can be viewed.  The comp is strong with subjects placed strategically in the frame with a nice implied leading line.  Good eye to see this...good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the natural ease in which this photo can be viewed.  The comp is strong with subjects placed strategically in the frame with a nice implied leading line.  Good eye to see this...good luck in the challenge.', '2008-10-31 11:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034319, 733402, 30049, '<td valign="top">I think the story in this photo would be strong enough to stand on its'' own.  The selective desat is understandable in intention...just not sure that you needed it.  As someone who''s seen many photos here at DPC it feels like you''re trying to hold the viewer''s hand and force them to see what should be evident.  Maybe it''ll work and help your score (many voters don''t take the time to slow down and look...your post-processing should direct them to the point in the first couple seconds).  I do hope that you''ve kept this in a B/W format and put a print up somewhere to enjoy it.  :-)<br/> <br/>Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think the story in this photo would be strong enough to stand on its'' own.  The selective desat is understandable in intention...just not sure that you needed it.  As someone who''s seen many photos here at DPC it feels like you''re trying to hold the viewer''s hand and force them to see what should be evident.  Maybe it''ll work and help your score (many voters don''t take the time to slow down and look...your post-processing should direct them to the point in the first couple seconds).  I do hope that you''ve kept this in a B/W format and put a print up somewhere to enjoy it.  :-) Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-10-31 11:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034321, 733761, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''ve pushed this too far in post.  ???  I say that because of the grain/noisy areas and the flatness of the photo (it needs toning down and more contrast IMO).  I will say that you''ve created an authentic street scene of some interest.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like you''ve pushed this too far in post.  ???  I say that because of the grain/noisy areas and the flatness of the photo (it needs toning down and more contrast IMO).  I will say that you''ve created an authentic street scene of some interest.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-10-31 11:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034324, 733714, 30049, '<td valign="top">A little heavy on the noise reduction, but a nice photo nonetheless.  The blue paperbox and the blue jacket make this shot work.  Nicely seen.</td>', 'A little heavy on the noise reduction, but a nice photo nonetheless.  The blue paperbox and the blue jacket make this shot work.  Nicely seen.', '2008-10-31 11:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034404, 733821, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like how the warm autumn colors frame the black subjects. I think I''d like it a little more if I could see their faces and expressions... I''d feel a little more connected. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like how the warm autumn colors frame the black subjects. I think I''d like it a little more if I could see their faces and expressions... I''d feel a little more connected. Nice shot.', '2008-10-31 13:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034405, 733505, 88204, '<td valign="top">How unusual! Works great in black and white.</td>', 'How unusual! Works great in black and white.', '2008-10-31 13:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034411, 733887, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like the cloud of gulls. The composition of the man in the background seems a little too close to the main subject. I can''t decide if he''s relevant or not. Black and white on the beach is good to force the viewer out of seeing it as a typical beach shot.</td>', 'I like the cloud of gulls. The composition of the man in the background seems a little too close to the main subject. I can''t decide if he''s relevant or not. Black and white on the beach is good to force the viewer out of seeing it as a typical beach shot.', '2008-10-31 13:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034413, 733910, 88204, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites so far. It''s interesting to see the group gathered around the game. Shallow DoF helps to focus on the card player. My favorite thing about it is the eye contact from the one individual. That connects the viewer to the scene.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites so far. It''s interesting to see the group gathered around the game. Shallow DoF helps to focus on the card player. My favorite thing about it is the eye contact from the one individual. That connects the viewer to the scene.', '2008-10-31 13:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034414, 733604, 88204, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic... I assume you brought out the lights and darks via post processing. It has a glow to it that I like.</td>', 'Very dramatic... I assume you brought out the lights and darks via post processing. It has a glow to it that I like.', '2008-10-31 13:15:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5034418, 733871, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great portrait of an interesting subject! Very intimate and up close. I like it that we can see his eyes, teeth, whiskers and every detail on his face. Two things that could improve it... 1) direct eye contact with his left eye and 2) just a touch more lights... it seems to be overall very neutral gray.<br/> <br/>Excellent shot. My favorite so far. 9</td>', 'Great portrait of an interesting subject! Very intimate and up close. I like it that we can see his eyes, teeth, whiskers and every detail on his face. Two things that could improve it... 1) direct eye contact with his left eye and 2) just a touch more lights... it seems to be overall very neutral gray. Excellent shot. My favorite so far. 9', '2008-10-31 13:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034423, 733421, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot but (sorry to say) I think it''s mostly because of the cool images in the background, which I assume aren''t your images. I like your lighting and how you silhoutted them against the bright images. I especially like the pose of the person on the left... something about it adds interest. 7</td>', 'I like this a lot but (sorry to say) I think it''s mostly because of the cool images in the background, which I assume aren''t your images. I like your lighting and how you silhoutted them against the bright images. I especially like the pose of the person on the left... something about it adds interest. 7', '2008-10-31 13:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034424, 733508, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject but I wish you would have approached him and asked for a close up.</td>', 'Interesting subject but I wish you would have approached him and asked for a close up.', '2008-10-31 13:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034427, 733330, 88204, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and use of shallow DoF (or is it a lens baby?). Very striking image, works well in B&amp;W. 8</td>', 'Excellent composition and use of shallow DoF (or is it a lens baby?). Very striking image, works well in B&W. 8', '2008-10-31 13:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034429, 733815, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great subject. I wish you would have approached him and gotten a close up.</td>', 'Great subject. I wish you would have approached him and gotten a close up.', '2008-10-31 13:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034431, 733636, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, the composition and the technical capture. The post processing is dramatic and I can certainly see this as a publishable photo. My personal preference would be for a less harsh presentation, but that''s a personal reaction. Well done!</td>', 'I like the subject, the composition and the technical capture. The post processing is dramatic and I can certainly see this as a publishable photo. My personal preference would be for a less harsh presentation, but that''s a personal reaction. Well done!', '2008-10-31 13:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034432, 732913, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great eye contact! I like how the viewer can get a glimpse of the environment via the reflection in the glass. I think I''d like it better if you had moved in a couple steps and gotten as close as possible without losing the reflections.</td>', 'Great eye contact! I like how the viewer can get a glimpse of the environment via the reflection in the glass. I think I''d like it better if you had moved in a couple steps and gotten as close as possible without losing the reflections.', '2008-10-31 13:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034434, 733873, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like the figure on the left with the cane and backlighting. I think you could have cropped out the guy on the right so our attention would focus on the guy on the left.</td>', 'I like the figure on the left with the cane and backlighting. I think you could have cropped out the guy on the right so our attention would focus on the guy on the left.', '2008-10-31 13:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034436, 733604, 18197, '<td valign="top">Interesting and dramatic feel to this. I like the B&amp;W and the high contrast. Great whites and blacks. Personally though, I''d prefer a subtler post processing treatment.</td>', 'Interesting and dramatic feel to this. I like the B&W and the high contrast. Great whites and blacks. Personally though, I''d prefer a subtler post processing treatment.', '2008-10-31 13:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034437, 733756, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I wish her eyes were open. I think you could also have cropped out the shooter on the left (although that may be part of what you wanted to capture).</td>', 'Interesting shot. I wish her eyes were open. I think you could also have cropped out the shooter on the left (although that may be part of what you wanted to capture).', '2008-10-31 13:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034438, 733714, 88204, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of color. I wish you could have gotten his attention and made eye contact.</td>', 'Interesting use of color. I wish you could have gotten his attention and made eye contact.', '2008-10-31 13:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034439, 733642, 18197, '<td valign="top">Brilliant focus makes your point beautifully. Hope folks don''t miss it in the rush to vote!</td>', 'Brilliant focus makes your point beautifully. Hope folks don''t miss it in the rush to vote!', '2008-10-31 13:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034440, 733298, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great colors, interesting subject. I wish she was making eye contact with the camera.</td>', 'Great colors, interesting subject. I wish she was making eye contact with the camera.', '2008-10-31 13:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034441, 733889, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not getting the connection to the theme.</td>', 'Not getting the connection to the theme.', '2008-10-31 13:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034444, 732647, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the composition ... because of the leading lines, the centered composition works. Low key works. Processed a bit further than I would prefer.</td>', 'I like the composition ... because of the leading lines, the centered composition works. Low key works. Processed a bit further than I would prefer.', '2008-10-31 13:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034446, 733793, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great expressions and eye contact. Orange and green work nicely together too.</td>', 'Great expressions and eye contact. Orange and green work nicely together too.', '2008-10-31 13:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034448, 733823, 18197, '<td valign="top">I know it''s meant to be dark, but on my calibrated monitor it''s too dark to fully appreciate.</td>', 'I know it''s meant to be dark, but on my calibrated monitor it''s too dark to fully appreciate.', '2008-10-31 13:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034449, 733524, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like this shot but I think it''s mostly becuase of the great image in the background. Interesting juxtoposition of size.</td>', 'I like this shot but I think it''s mostly becuase of the great image in the background. Interesting juxtoposition of size.', '2008-10-31 13:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034452, 733794, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lots of layered meaning here. Like that about the photo.</td>', 'Lots of layered meaning here. Like that about the photo.', '2008-10-31 13:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034460, 733814, 18197, '<td valign="top">I love to photograph grafitti art. In this case, the person in the upper right kind of makes the image. Too bad there wasn''t more light on her. Many will miss this hidden gem in their rush to vote.</td>', 'I love to photograph grafitti art. In this case, the person in the upper right kind of makes the image. Too bad there wasn''t more light on her. Many will miss this hidden gem in their rush to vote.', '2008-10-31 13:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034515, 733823, 81530, '<td valign="top">Great result! - Good choice with the B&amp;W. No Vote</td>', 'Great result! - Good choice with the B&W. No Vote', '2008-10-31 14:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034516, 733821, 81530, '<td valign="top">Contrary to what the title says, it is something special</td>', 'Contrary to what the title says, it is something special', '2008-10-31 14:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5034518, 733801, 81530, '<td valign="top">Good editing. It suits the scene well. - No Vote</td>', 'Good editing. It suits the scene well. - No Vote', '2008-10-31 14:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
