(5035340, 733402, 49773, '<td valign="top">If you hadn''t done the selective desaturation this would''ve been so much more powerful, otherwise it really detracts from this fabulous capture. Amazing photograph! This is so moving that I can''t help regreting you almost ruined it with the unnecessary editing.</td>', 'If you hadn''t done the selective desaturation this would''ve been so much more powerful, otherwise it really detracts from this fabulous capture. Amazing photograph! This is so moving that I can''t help regreting you almost ruined it with the unnecessary editing.', '2008-10-31 22:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5035399, 733424, 75713, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment only:<br/> <br/>This is a case of where SP doesn''t need humans - when I take the time to study the pigeons I see them in different groupings - I do anthropomorphism very well :) and imagine what they are doing/saying ... I like the oof bird in the f/g - nicely done.</td>', 'Coming back to comment only: This is a case of where SP doesn''t need humans - when I take the time to study the pigeons I see them in different groupings - I do anthropomorphism very well :) and imagine what they are doing/saying ... I like the oof bird in the f/g - nicely done.', '2008-10-31 23:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5035601, 733330, 13688, '<td valign="top">not your standard street shot.  i feel like i''m looking at model railroad people...very cool and unique.  The focus is a big part of what does it for me.</td>', 'not your standard street shot.  i feel like i''m looking at model railroad people...very cool and unique.  The focus is a big part of what does it for me.', '2008-11-01 00:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5035612, 733226, 13688, '<td valign="top">the paint processing gives it an interesting feel for me.  I wish he had a more plain background with the building on his side...perhaps that wasn''t an option</td>', 'the paint processing gives it an interesting feel for me.  I wish he had a more plain background with the building on his side...perhaps that wasn''t an option', '2008-11-01 00:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
