(5035648, 733918, 13688, '<td valign="top">really like the colors and lighting.  wish the right edge ended on the light for a more balanced composition for me.  more candid than street style...but who cares about rules...nice photo</td>', 'really like the colors and lighting.  wish the right edge ended on the light for a more balanced composition for me.  more candid than street style...but who cares about rules...nice photo', '2008-11-01 00:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
