(5035690, 733571, 13688, '<td valign="top">this reminds me of a shot i took..."similarity in diversity"...i like that the theme caries into the shop.  You''ll have a tough time keeping people''s attention with the busy background.</td>', 'this reminds me of a shot i took..."similarity in diversity"...i like that the theme caries into the shop.  You''ll have a tough time keeping people''s attention with the busy background.', '2008-11-01 01:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5035694, 733480, 13688, '<td valign="top">ahhh...nice to see something i haven''t seen before.  half way through and this is the first shot to really smack me around.</td>', 'ahhh...nice to see something i haven''t seen before.  half way through and this is the first shot to really smack me around.', '2008-11-01 01:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5035703, 733515, 13688, '<td valign="top">this is obviously a very odd scene...and everything screams street photography...and the body position and interest of the spectators is fascinating and the walking icons with arrows are cool...but I still feel  something bigger is missing from this...it most likely is just me...sorry</td>', 'this is obviously a very odd scene...and everything screams street photography...and the body position and interest of the spectators is fascinating and the walking icons with arrows are cool...but I still feel  something bigger is missing from this...it most likely is just me...sorry', '2008-11-01 01:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
