(5035745, 733718, 47791, '<td valign="top">I like the sharpness and contrast of this shot. <br/>The eyes of the player make it for me. <br/> <br/>Another pluse is the busy background. Cop car and pedestrians etc. really meets the challenge well. <br/> <br/>Also its nice to know what Santa Claus does to tide him over during the year. <br/> <br/>7/10</td>', 'I like the sharpness and contrast of this shot. The eyes of the player make it for me.  Another pluse is the busy background. Cop car and pedestrians etc. really meets the challenge well.  Also its nice to know what Santa Claus does to tide him over during the year.  7/10', '2008-11-01 02:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
