(5035824, 733435, 68504, '<td valign="top">Well I do just like this. The (flying) pigeon is just flat out, and the buttresses and the large person are just there.</td>', 'Well I do just like this. The (flying) pigeon is just flat out, and the buttresses and the large person are just there.', '2008-11-01 04:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
