(5035827, 733424, 68504, '<td valign="top">There should be a word for this. As it is, the colours of the pigeons mirrored (!) by the colours of the background buildings tie this urban thing all together despite the delighful orgy of pigeon mayhem.</td>', 'There should be a word for this. As it is, the colours of the pigeons mirrored (!) by the colours of the background buildings tie this urban thing all together despite the delighful orgy of pigeon mayhem.', '2008-11-01 04:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5036331, 733908, 4493, '<td valign="top">Interesting person you''ve captured. I think with as much pixels as cameras have now days, that if you had cropped out from his waist down, and had him fill the frame we''d have seen a strong composition that keeps the eye from wandering away from him. His mic stand pull my eye right down to the sidewalk and out the frame as it is cropped now. Scratch that... if you do that, you lose a sense of where he''s at. Not sure, but I feel there''s a stronger crop, but messing with my browser size and moving him around, I''ll be danged if I can find it. Maybe this is as good as this image gets.</td>', 'Interesting person you''ve captured. I think with as much pixels as cameras have now days, that if you had cropped out from his waist down, and had him fill the frame we''d have seen a strong composition that keeps the eye from wandering away from him. His mic stand pull my eye right down to the sidewalk and out the frame as it is cropped now. Scratch that... if you do that, you lose a sense of where he''s at. Not sure, but I feel there''s a stronger crop, but messing with my browser size and moving him around, I''ll be danged if I can find it. Maybe this is as good as this image gets.', '2008-11-01 10:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5036386, 733796, 4493, '<td valign="top">What mission? I think the viewer has no sense of what''s going on here other than maybe having gone to the store for some detergent? Overall colors in the shot are fine, but there is no main subject/idea conveyed to me or the viewer.</td>', 'What mission? I think the viewer has no sense of what''s going on here other than maybe having gone to the store for some detergent? Overall colors in the shot are fine, but there is no main subject/idea conveyed to me or the viewer.', '2008-11-01 10:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5036413, 733887, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m trying hard to find something in the shot other than you secretly snapping a pic of a lady on the beach. I have no idea what she''s looking at, she''s not strolling in the shot... just trying my best to ''get it''.</td>', 'I''m trying hard to find something in the shot other than you secretly snapping a pic of a lady on the beach. I have no idea what she''s looking at, she''s not strolling in the shot... just trying my best to ''get it''.', '2008-11-01 10:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5036422, 733902, 4493, '<td valign="top">Colorful characters you have here. Only thing is with your desaturation I feel without it being a true b/w desaturation, it works against what you''re trying to accomplish. Try a true b/w desat, with a vignette to help eliminate border clutter and see if the image is stronger.</td>', 'Colorful characters you have here. Only thing is with your desaturation I feel without it being a true b/w desaturation, it works against what you''re trying to accomplish. Try a true b/w desat, with a vignette to help eliminate border clutter and see if the image is stronger.', '2008-11-01 10:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5036425, 733718, 4493, '<td valign="top">Those are some worn out gloves. I can see the years of street playing in his face. Like the composition and focus. The over saturation works nicely as well. Good capture.</td>', 'Those are some worn out gloves. I can see the years of street playing in his face. Like the composition and focus. The over saturation works nicely as well. Good capture.', '2008-11-01 10:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5036428, 733604, 4493, '<td valign="top">Since the person is walking to stage left... perhaps waiting until he was between the pole and frame left would place him better in the shot. From a personal preference, I''m not overly fond of this style post-processing. I know that everyone is different, so I won''t take off for that, but I do feel it competes with your main subject.</td>', 'Since the person is walking to stage left... perhaps waiting until he was between the pole and frame left would place him better in the shot. From a personal preference, I''m not overly fond of this style post-processing. I know that everyone is different, so I won''t take off for that, but I do feel it competes with your main subject.', '2008-11-01 10:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5036436, 733298, 4493, '<td valign="top">Playing around with my browser size, if I crop from the top of the trees up out of the image, and from the right of the yellow border behind her to the right out of the image, I see a much stronger shot. There is less ''edge distraction'' and I can focus more on the main subject. Her pose is engaging and I like the colors throughout in contrast to her monochromatic outfit. The textures of the bricks play off nicely against her fur vest. Nice capture. Try the re-crop to see if you agree.</td>', 'Playing around with my browser size, if I crop from the top of the trees up out of the image, and from the right of the yellow border behind her to the right out of the image, I see a much stronger shot. There is less ''edge distraction'' and I can focus more on the main subject. Her pose is engaging and I like the colors throughout in contrast to her monochromatic outfit. The textures of the bricks play off nicely against her fur vest. Nice capture. Try the re-crop to see if you agree.', '2008-11-01 11:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5036587, 733784, 70265, '<td valign="top">love the urban acid-y feel, composition and dark edges. Oh, nice hat too!</td>', 'love the urban acid-y feel, composition and dark edges. Oh, nice hat too!', '2008-11-01 12:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5036677, 733715, 56502, '<td valign="top">It''s a pity it''s so blurred - the picture as such is a nice capture.</td>', 'It''s a pity it''s so blurred - the picture as such is a nice capture.', '2008-11-01 13:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037032, 733351, 30214, '<td valign="top">I knew it was yours even before I stumbled upon your "affluence" shot :). Lovely echo between poses of the the man on the street and in the painting. Makes me wonder, maybe there is a woman behind him somewhere? And the tonal rage is great as always. What is it on the wall, by the way, Titian, Rubens? Looks generally familiar but I can''t place it</td>', 'I knew it was yours even before I stumbled upon your "affluence" shot :). Lovely echo between poses of the the man on the street and in the painting. Makes me wonder, maybe there is a woman behind him somewhere? And the tonal rage is great as always. What is it on the wall, by the way, Titian, Rubens? Looks generally familiar but I can''t place it', '2008-11-01 18:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037054, 733729, 2389, '<td valign="top">cute idea - nice composition...</td>', 'cute idea - nice composition...', '2008-11-01 18:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037057, 733379, 2389, '<td valign="top">Made me chuckle - great capture!</td>', 'Made me chuckle - great capture!', '2008-11-01 18:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
