(5037063, 732866, 2389, '<td valign="top">This would be an amazing shot if it were a bit more in focus. As it is, I give it a 7 for the subject matter and the position of the girl caught in the act!</td>', 'This would be an amazing shot if it were a bit more in focus. As it is, I give it a 7 for the subject matter and the position of the girl caught in the act!', '2008-11-01 18:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
