(5037476, 733561, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice composition...the question is did he really stick the landing?</td>', 'nice composition...the question is did he really stick the landing?', '2008-11-01 22:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037487, 733704, 13688, '<td valign="top">If the text was important to me I might have gone with a smaller aperture for longer focus.</td>', 'If the text was important to me I might have gone with a smaller aperture for longer focus.', '2008-11-01 22:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037493, 732711, 13688, '<td valign="top">interesting inverse border.</td>', 'interesting inverse border.', '2008-11-01 22:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037499, 733887, 13688, '<td valign="top">the large swarm of seagulls is very interesting to me...not sure that was your intent though.</td>', 'the large swarm of seagulls is very interesting to me...not sure that was your intent though.', '2008-11-01 22:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037506, 733665, 13688, '<td valign="top">nice lines textures and lines.  wish it wasn''t so exposed that i''m missing some of the details.</td>', 'nice lines textures and lines.  wish it wasn''t so exposed that i''m missing some of the details.', '2008-11-01 22:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037513, 733909, 13688, '<td valign="top">unique perspective.</td>', 'unique perspective.', '2008-11-01 22:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037560, 733340, 13688, '<td valign="top">technically i''m awful...but if you''re going to get good at this shot i would think you need not worry about over exposing the background and shoot for his face.  perhaps getting it great is just impossible with that much ambient light and not being able to use a light meter on him.  feels like you overdid the mid range level boost in post processing to try to improve his under exposure.</td>', 'technically i''m awful...but if you''re going to get good at this shot i would think you need not worry about over exposing the background and shoot for his face.  perhaps getting it great is just impossible with that much ambient light and not being able to use a light meter on him.  feels like you overdid the mid range level boost in post processing to try to improve his under exposure.', '2008-11-01 23:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037562, 733077, 13688, '<td valign="top">perplexing...you allude to the love of coffee, but then show an adbandoned cafe...</td>', 'perplexing...you allude to the love of coffee, but then show an adbandoned cafe...', '2008-11-01 23:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037594, 733784, 4493, '<td valign="top">Composition and post processing is nice.</td>', 'Composition and post processing is nice.', '2008-11-01 23:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037599, 733330, 4493, '<td valign="top">This image represents more of art than street photography. I think this would look very nice framed and hanging in one''s living room. The blur and toning are tasteful and work well with the shot.</td>', 'This image represents more of art than street photography. I think this would look very nice framed and hanging in one''s living room. The blur and toning are tasteful and work well with the shot.', '2008-11-01 23:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037604, 733636, 4493, '<td valign="top">The post processing is very painterly. The window sign with the subject in the window is a nice study. I am not usually fond of this type of post processing, but do feel it works well with your overall feel you''re going for.</td>', 'The post processing is very painterly. The window sign with the subject in the window is a nice study. I am not usually fond of this type of post processing, but do feel it works well with your overall feel you''re going for.', '2008-11-01 23:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037612, 733580, 4493, '<td valign="top">Extreme zoom, extreme crop, and noise reduction detract from the moment captured. This feels just like a snap at a soccer field, and less an image you set out to take for the challenge. Child is cute, but the photo itself doesn''t work with her cuteness and it feels like it was entered just to have something to refresh during the week.</td>', 'Extreme zoom, extreme crop, and noise reduction detract from the moment captured. This feels just like a snap at a soccer field, and less an image you set out to take for the challenge. Child is cute, but the photo itself doesn''t work with her cuteness and it feels like it was entered just to have something to refresh during the week.', '2008-11-01 23:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037633, 733803, 4493, '<td valign="top">Two kids on the left have my interest. Right side of the frame, to me, has less interest.</td>', 'Two kids on the left have my interest. Right side of the frame, to me, has less interest.', '2008-11-01 23:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037635, 733613, 4493, '<td valign="top">I appreciate you engaging the subject in this shot. I like the person behind him smiling. Nice image and toning.</td>', 'I appreciate you engaging the subject in this shot. I like the person behind him smiling. Nice image and toning.', '2008-11-01 23:59:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037639, 733434, 4493, '<td valign="top">Crop the left and bottom and you''ll have a much stronger shot. We have enough megapixels now that we can crop in and still retain high quality. Nice post processing as well.</td>', 'Crop the left and bottom and you''ll have a much stronger shot. We have enough megapixels now that we can crop in and still retain high quality. Nice post processing as well.', '2008-11-02 00:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037686, 733617, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the leading angles here, and the texture of the cobblestones. A nice contrasty b/w. Looks like she spotted you taking her picture.</td>', 'I like the leading angles here, and the texture of the cobblestones. A nice contrasty b/w. Looks like she spotted you taking her picture.', '2008-11-02 00:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037689, 733739, 83313, '<td valign="top">An American muscle car is pretty much out of place in the UK. I like this. Nice tones and detail.</td>', 'An American muscle car is pretty much out of place in the UK. I like this. Nice tones and detail.', '2008-11-02 00:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037693, 733790, 83313, '<td valign="top">I do like this, but it''s not exactly the idea behind street photography (and I thought I had missed the target!) I''m afraid it would not be fair for me to give this the good vote it would have otherwise had. Kudos for an excellent shoehorn effort, however.</td>', 'I do like this, but it''s not exactly the idea behind street photography (and I thought I had missed the target!) I''m afraid it would not be fair for me to give this the good vote it would have otherwise had. Kudos for an excellent shoehorn effort, however.', '2008-11-02 00:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037700, 733886, 83313, '<td valign="top">A very "in your face shot". Not sure if there is any story to this one or not. I''ll have to read your notes if you left any.</td>', 'A very "in your face shot". Not sure if there is any story to this one or not. I''ll have to read your notes if you left any.', '2008-11-02 00:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037707, 733787, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not caring for this, I''m afraid. It does not seem as much like street photography as you were out shooting with a buddy and took a picture of him. Nothing about it really jumps out at me.</td>', 'I''m not caring for this, I''m afraid. It does not seem as much like street photography as you were out shooting with a buddy and took a picture of him. Nothing about it really jumps out at me.', '2008-11-02 00:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037708, 733438, 83313, '<td valign="top">But I would <b>like</b> to know her...</td>', 'But I would like to know her...', '2008-11-02 00:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037714, 733580, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a snapshot at a soccer game. The while image seems a bit soft and fuzzy around the edges. Not sure what might have caused that look.</td>', 'Looks like a snapshot at a soccer game. The while image seems a bit soft and fuzzy around the edges. Not sure what might have caused that look.', '2008-11-02 00:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037718, 733801, 83313, '<td valign="top">I really like this, it has a clear urban feel. However it looks staged and not really the kind of thing that is true street photography. I apologize if that is an incorrect assessment.</td>', 'I really like this, it has a clear urban feel. However it looks staged and not really the kind of thing that is true street photography. I apologize if that is an incorrect assessment.', '2008-11-02 00:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037720, 733298, 83313, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the costumes from one of the original "Star Trek" episodes.</td>', 'Reminds me of the costumes from one of the original "Star Trek" episodes.', '2008-11-02 00:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037724, 733330, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like some photoshopped DOF. Might have looked more natural if you had blurred the boards closer to the bottom. I do like this, though it may not be the strong in your face story that some others are looking for in this challenge. I''ll be interested in seeing where this places.</td>', 'Looks like some photoshopped DOF. Might have looked more natural if you had blurred the boards closer to the bottom. I do like this, though it may not be the strong in your face story that some others are looking for in this challenge. I''ll be interested in seeing where this places.', '2008-11-02 00:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037726, 733876, 83313, '<td valign="top">Interesting mix of sepia and color. Not sure whether I care for the look as it is used here or not. Still a good strong image to me.</td>', 'Interesting mix of sepia and color. Not sure whether I care for the look as it is used here or not. Still a good strong image to me.', '2008-11-02 00:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037823, 733298, 69668, '<td valign="top">You know I dig this shot.  I hope you are doing well.</td>', 'You know I dig this shot.  I hope you are doing well.', '2008-11-02 01:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037859, 733644, 88523, '<td valign="top">Street photography of wedding photography...nice.  I like the hands embracing the bride.</td>', 'Street photography of wedding photography...nice.  I like the hands embracing the bride.', '2008-11-02 01:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037861, 733385, 88523, '<td valign="top">Ha! Seems like the dog just hit them for a drag and is on his merry way...</td>', 'Ha! Seems like the dog just hit them for a drag and is on his merry way...', '2008-11-02 01:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037863, 732913, 88523, '<td valign="top">A lot of character in this guy... Judging form his noes and knuckles I figure he scraps as well...</td>', 'A lot of character in this guy... Judging form his noes and knuckles I figure he scraps as well...', '2008-11-02 01:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037865, 733912, 88523, '<td valign="top">What a lovely photo... the blurred woman in the background alludes to a lot of possibilities... I scrolled down and saw it with the mother''s head a bit cropped bringing more focus on the baby and woman walking towards them and liked it that way also.  Very nice image...8</td>', 'What a lovely photo... the blurred woman in the background alludes to a lot of possibilities... I scrolled down and saw it with the mother''s head a bit cropped bringing more focus on the baby and woman walking towards them and liked it that way also.  Very nice image...8', '2008-11-02 02:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037866, 733463, 88523, '<td valign="top">Nice moment and well composed...there is so much beyond there intimacy to look at although a bit hazy.</td>', 'Nice moment and well composed...there is so much beyond there intimacy to look at although a bit hazy.', '2008-11-02 02:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5037945, 733715, 88523, '<td valign="top">Using the rain...the graininess of this intensifies the woman''s predicament...</td>', 'Using the rain...the graininess of this intensifies the woman''s predicament...', '2008-11-02 05:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038021, 733465, 99664, '<td valign="top">i like the play on long exposure here.</td>', 'i like the play on long exposure here.', '2008-11-02 06:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
