(5038206, 732711, 7810, '<td valign="top">This is one of the shots that cries to be converted to BW and says lose the border. I say try this<br/>Up the contrast slightly ... lose the border ... and convert to BW ... slight adjust to levels ...<br/>This shot would be top 10.   Great capture</td>', 'This is one of the shots that cries to be converted to BW and says lose the border. I say try thisUp the contrast slightly ... lose the border ... and convert to BW ... slight adjust to levels ...This shot would be top 10.   Great capture', '2008-11-02 08:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
