(5038211, 733572, 7810, '<td valign="top">This is a great image in need of a few tweaks IMO<br/>I would like to see the contrast up a bit as well as the levels up.<br/>This would help(again IMO) with the conversion to BW.<br/> <br/>I love the pedestrian walking away from camera I also love all of the men on the rack above the truck.<br/> <br/>I would have been the guy running down the street trying to get a shot of all those guys above the truck</td>', 'This is a great image in need of a few tweaks IMOI would like to see the contrast up a bit as well as the levels up.This would help(again IMO) with the conversion to BW. I love the pedestrian walking away from camera I also love all of the men on the rack above the truck. I would have been the guy running down the street trying to get a shot of all those guys above the truck', '2008-11-02 08:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038212, 733794, 7810, '<td valign="top">A very compelling shot ... good capture</td>', 'A very compelling shot ... good capture', '2008-11-02 08:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
