(5038350, 733822, 4493, '<td valign="top">They have a long wait ahead of them by the looks of the street. I think the lines of the street and the line of light poles really help move the eye around in the shot. Overall nice shot.</td>', 'They have a long wait ahead of them by the looks of the street. I think the lines of the street and the line of light poles really help move the eye around in the shot. Overall nice shot.', '2008-11-02 09:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038353, 733912, 4493, '<td valign="top">I feel the subject is a little tight on the edge of the frame, and that a true b/w conversion would make for a stronger image.</td>', 'I feel the subject is a little tight on the edge of the frame, and that a true b/w conversion would make for a stronger image.', '2008-11-02 09:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038359, 733388, 4493, '<td valign="top">As interesting as the bike is, I don''t feel it adds to this shot. I tried a square crop and if you cloned out the little bit of wheel left after the crop, I think it works a little better as you then concentrate your attention on the people and aren''t pulled off to the right looking at the bike. Really nice capture with interesting subjects.</td>', 'As interesting as the bike is, I don''t feel it adds to this shot. I tried a square crop and if you cloned out the little bit of wheel left after the crop, I think it works a little better as you then concentrate your attention on the people and aren''t pulled off to the right looking at the bike. Really nice capture with interesting subjects.', '2008-11-02 09:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038363, 733798, 4493, '<td valign="top">Composition is strong. I''m not one for selective saturation but that being said, it works to convey your idea.</td>', 'Composition is strong. I''m not one for selective saturation but that being said, it works to convey your idea.', '2008-11-02 09:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038367, 733802, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it''s my old age, monitor, or what, but the image feels a little soft. Compositionally it''s fine. I like how the camera is lower than just normal standing height to take the shot.</td>', 'Not sure if it''s my old age, monitor, or what, but the image feels a little soft. Compositionally it''s fine. I like how the camera is lower than just normal standing height to take the shot.', '2008-11-02 09:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038369, 733814, 4493, '<td valign="top">wow, took me a second to find the photographer in the image. Try boosting your saturation, and brightness and contrast just a bit on this. It may really make it pop more.</td>', 'wow, took me a second to find the photographer in the image. Try boosting your saturation, and brightness and contrast just a bit on this. It may really make it pop more.', '2008-11-02 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038374, 733642, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasting elements. Crop just a little off the left for a true square crop. Otherwise, strong photo.</td>', 'Nice contrasting elements. Crop just a little off the left for a true square crop. Otherwise, strong photo.', '2008-11-02 09:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038378, 733889, 4493, '<td valign="top">I guess the group of birds as interest to the image. I''m trying to ''feel'' the shot... but not getting much other than a random guy on a beach in the morning looking for metal. If that''s all you were trying to convey, then you''ve achieved that. Your distance and angle have you so far removed from the subject, that it''s hard to evoke much else from the image.</td>', 'I guess the group of birds as interest to the image. I''m trying to ''feel'' the shot... but not getting much other than a random guy on a beach in the morning looking for metal. If that''s all you were trying to convey, then you''ve achieved that. Your distance and angle have you so far removed from the subject, that it''s hard to evoke much else from the image.', '2008-11-02 09:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038383, 733674, 4493, '<td valign="top">You''ve used the rule of 3rds here. Post processing is fine. Not a whole lot else going on.</td>', 'You''ve used the rule of 3rds here. Post processing is fine. Not a whole lot else going on.', '2008-11-02 09:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038387, 733382, 4493, '<td valign="top">wow, there is someone in there... they''re so small I almost missed them. As a landscape study this is a good shot, but you''d need to remove the person. As a ''street'' shot, I feel we''re too far away from the subject to get a sense of who and what they are.</td>', 'wow, there is someone in there... they''re so small I almost missed them. As a landscape study this is a good shot, but you''d need to remove the person. As a ''street'' shot, I feel we''re too far away from the subject to get a sense of who and what they are.', '2008-11-02 09:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038391, 733387, 4493, '<td valign="top">You know, I really feel that this technique could be used to achieve some cool affects. I think just one ''ghost'' would have been strong enough, and maybe reposition the camera so that the brightest street light is just off screen so it doesn''t compete so strongly with your ''ghosts''.</td>', 'You know, I really feel that this technique could be used to achieve some cool affects. I think just one ''ghost'' would have been strong enough, and maybe reposition the camera so that the brightest street light is just off screen so it doesn''t compete so strongly with your ''ghosts''.', '2008-11-02 09:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038392, 733421, 4493, '<td valign="top">Well framed, good subjects, nice post processing. I like this beyond just a street shot. Good human element.</td>', 'Well framed, good subjects, nice post processing. I like this beyond just a street shot. Good human element.', '2008-11-02 09:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038395, 733738, 4493, '<td valign="top">Technically met the challenge, but the distance you are from the subject and the benches on the right compete for attention and pull the viewer''s eyes off the frame to the right instead of leading me to the man picking up the trash.</td>', 'Technically met the challenge, but the distance you are from the subject and the benches on the right compete for attention and pull the viewer''s eyes off the frame to the right instead of leading me to the man picking up the trash.', '2008-11-02 09:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038399, 733062, 4493, '<td valign="top">Talk about magic hour light. The light and framing are great. Not sure that I get a sense of ''street photography'' on this though. Outside of your control, had they been crossing the street without the car turning, the image would be a lot more powerful. The car steals attention from the crosswalkers.</td>', 'Talk about magic hour light. The light and framing are great. Not sure that I get a sense of ''street photography'' on this though. Outside of your control, had they been crossing the street without the car turning, the image would be a lot more powerful. The car steals attention from the crosswalkers.', '2008-11-02 09:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038405, 733524, 4493, '<td valign="top">These are always fun shots. A fashion ad being walked by, by someone who clearly has an interest in fashion is a nice touch.</td>', 'These are always fun shots. A fashion ad being walked by, by someone who clearly has an interest in fashion is a nice touch.', '2008-11-02 09:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038409, 733704, 4493, '<td valign="top">I know that you used the right of the frame to help with your title, but if you crop that and have a square crop, you have a stronger human interest shot.</td>', 'I know that you used the right of the frame to help with your title, but if you crop that and have a square crop, you have a stronger human interest shot.', '2008-11-02 09:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038412, 733635, 4493, '<td valign="top">Too much crammed up at the top of the shot. The negative space isn''t adding any value to the shot.</td>', 'Too much crammed up at the top of the shot. The negative space isn''t adding any value to the shot.', '2008-11-02 09:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038416, 733140, 4493, '<td valign="top">This shot documents more than just a room of people, it shows how in America a lot of parents let their kids run the show and are too afraid to stand up to them and make them realize they''re just kids. I''m sure not many people spent the time to analyze this from the shot, but it''s what I got.</td>', 'This shot documents more than just a room of people, it shows how in America a lot of parents let their kids run the show and are too afraid to stand up to them and make them realize they''re just kids. I''m sure not many people spent the time to analyze this from the shot, but it''s what I got.', '2008-11-02 09:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038420, 733753, 4493, '<td valign="top">I don''t get this. Had you been on the otherside of the monitor to capture this person''s face/expression I may have been more likely to get it, but this angle and the amount of zoom lens you use, I feel as far away from the subject as you were.</td>', 'I don''t get this. Had you been on the otherside of the monitor to capture this person''s face/expression I may have been more likely to get it, but this angle and the amount of zoom lens you use, I feel as far away from the subject as you were.', '2008-11-02 09:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038421, 733549, 4493, '<td valign="top">Photography is like riding a bike... you''ll fail a lot before you master it, but once you have mastered it, you can do it the rest of your life. Keep studying what works in the top 10 on DPC and your skills will improve dramatically.</td>', 'Photography is like riding a bike... you''ll fail a lot before you master it, but once you have mastered it, you can do it the rest of your life. Keep studying what works in the top 10 on DPC and your skills will improve dramatically.', '2008-11-02 09:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038423, 733907, 4493, '<td valign="top">Man, just a bit more space on frame right, and a this would be great. He just feels squeezed off frame. I''m torn if we need the person that is cut in half on frame left. They add to the ''street dancing'' feel, but almost compete with your main dancers for attention. High energy and good toning.</td>', 'Man, just a bit more space on frame right, and a this would be great. He just feels squeezed off frame. I''m torn if we need the person that is cut in half on frame left. They add to the ''street dancing'' feel, but almost compete with your main dancers for attention. High energy and good toning.', '2008-11-02 09:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038425, 733379, 4493, '<td valign="top">This is a fun shot. Maybe a little heavily post processed, but overall a good capture.</td>', 'This is a fun shot. Maybe a little heavily post processed, but overall a good capture.', '2008-11-02 09:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038428, 733883, 4493, '<td valign="top">How many people who don''t know what a handsome cab is have commented on this man''s looks? My guess is a lot. Your desaturation level is ok, but not sure it''s the best treatment. Try a good b/w conversion with true blacks. Might make this be a better character study.</td>', 'How many people who don''t know what a handsome cab is have commented on this man''s looks? My guess is a lot. Your desaturation level is ok, but not sure it''s the best treatment. Try a good b/w conversion with true blacks. Might make this be a better character study.', '2008-11-02 09:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038430, 733894, 4493, '<td valign="top">Candidate for black and white?</td>', 'Candidate for black and white?', '2008-11-02 09:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038433, 732973, 4493, '<td valign="top">Isn''t this peachy? Add some people racing to the bus and the bus not centered, and it could be an interesting shot.</td>', 'Isn''t this peachy? Add some people racing to the bus and the bus not centered, and it could be an interesting shot.', '2008-11-02 09:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038435, 733486, 4493, '<td valign="top">Your toning and post processing on this shot really really make it. The subjects are fun to look at and the overall balance of the shot works. Very well executed.</td>', 'Your toning and post processing on this shot really really make it. The subjects are fun to look at and the overall balance of the shot works. Very well executed.', '2008-11-02 09:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038436, 733821, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nothing Special</td>', 'Nothing Special', '2008-11-02 09:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038440, 733391, 4493, '<td valign="top">This screams for you to be engaged with the person and have a tighter portrait shot with the balloons interacting with the photo. You may have reservations about approaching someone, but I feel he could be a great character study. The shot now is a little flat and disengaged.</td>', 'This screams for you to be engaged with the person and have a tighter portrait shot with the balloons interacting with the photo. You may have reservations about approaching someone, but I feel he could be a great character study. The shot now is a little flat and disengaged.', '2008-11-02 09:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038442, 733793, 4493, '<td valign="top">Well at least they''re looking at you and she appears to be enjoying herself.</td>', 'Well at least they''re looking at you and she appears to be enjoying herself.', '2008-11-02 09:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038445, 733149, 4493, '<td valign="top">People walking into the scene, in my opinion, will make for a stronger image, as I feel they become more of the scene. If we see them leaving the shot, then we are pulled out of the image and don''t pay attention to the rest of the shot. My eye goes from top middle, down the line to the tree, then the white ledge, to the person, and out the image.... it doesn''t return.</td>', 'People walking into the scene, in my opinion, will make for a stronger image, as I feel they become more of the scene. If we see them leaving the shot, then we are pulled out of the image and don''t pay attention to the rest of the shot. My eye goes from top middle, down the line to the tree, then the white ledge, to the person, and out the image.... it doesn''t return.', '2008-11-02 09:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038448, 733560, 4493, '<td valign="top">Color, toning, use of thirds is good. I just am not drawn into your image. This may not be true, but I feel you and a friend found this spot, and he posed for you. And since he doesn''t want people to see him, he''s covered his head with the hood. Like I said, I may be wrong, but that''s what I feel when I look at this shot.</td>', 'Color, toning, use of thirds is good. I just am not drawn into your image. This may not be true, but I feel you and a friend found this spot, and he posed for you. And since he doesn''t want people to see him, he''s covered his head with the hood. Like I said, I may be wrong, but that''s what I feel when I look at this shot.', '2008-11-02 09:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038449, 733644, 4493, '<td valign="top">I''m sure if someone was speed voting this shot, they''d miss all the faces in this shot and what each group is doing. While it may be a simple shot of a wedding party getting their photo taken, there''s more depth to the shot than the average voter will see. Good capture.</td>', 'I''m sure if someone was speed voting this shot, they''d miss all the faces in this shot and what each group is doing. While it may be a simple shot of a wedding party getting their photo taken, there''s more depth to the shot than the average voter will see. Good capture.', '2008-11-02 09:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038450, 733885, 4493, '<td valign="top">This shot conveys an unconditional love. With the grain in the image, did you try a black and white conversion?</td>', 'This shot conveys an unconditional love. With the grain in the image, did you try a black and white conversion?', '2008-11-02 09:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038453, 733815, 4493, '<td valign="top">Shots like this are hard to critique. Technically it''s good, the post processing is good, it''s just missing something that I can''t pinpoint. Maybe had a customer or onlooker been there watching him draw, that added human element would be the ''missing'' piece for me.</td>', 'Shots like this are hard to critique. Technically it''s good, the post processing is good, it''s just missing something that I can''t pinpoint. Maybe had a customer or onlooker been there watching him draw, that added human element would be the ''missing'' piece for me.', '2008-11-02 09:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038454, 733226, 4493, '<td valign="top">With the motion blur I can almost hear his melody. I think the tungsten cast on him competes with the buildings behind him. Would a b/w conversion work?</td>', 'With the motion blur I can almost hear his melody. I think the tungsten cast on him competes with the buildings behind him. Would a b/w conversion work?', '2008-11-02 09:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038455, 733870, 4493, '<td valign="top">I bet these two would be a more interesting subject from the front.</td>', 'I bet these two would be a more interesting subject from the front.', '2008-11-02 09:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038458, 733385, 4493, '<td valign="top">Not much I can add that your title hasn''t already. Crop off the right of the frame some so your subjects aren''t centered.</td>', 'Not much I can add that your title hasn''t already. Crop off the right of the frame some so your subjects aren''t centered.', '2008-11-02 10:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038460, 733810, 4493, '<td valign="top">You know... after spending a little while looking at this. The more I like it. I could see this framed and hanging on the wall. Nice capture of a moment in time. I feel the energy in the image and the large shadow adds a nice element.</td>', 'You know... after spending a little while looking at this. The more I like it. I could see this framed and hanging on the wall. Nice capture of a moment in time. I feel the energy in the image and the large shadow adds a nice element.', '2008-11-02 10:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038461, 733890, 4493, '<td valign="top">Hard way to make a living. A tighter crop on the guy in the white, and a black and white conversion that isn''t so dark might help make this a stronger story.</td>', 'Hard way to make a living. A tighter crop on the guy in the white, and a black and white conversion that isn''t so dark might help make this a stronger story.', '2008-11-02 10:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038464, 733708, 4493, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what''s going on here. The window is interesting, the guys are interesting, but when I add them all together, I am not really interested. I guess since the two men are so disengaged from each other, I don''t make a connection between them and their environment.</td>', 'I have no idea what''s going on here. The window is interesting, the guys are interesting, but when I add them all together, I am not really interested. I guess since the two men are so disengaged from each other, I don''t make a connection between them and their environment.', '2008-11-02 10:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038468, 733561, 4493, '<td valign="top">Only critique I would make is that from the right of the white pole over should be cropped out of the shot. They pull the viewer away from the skater... ah, but if you do that you lose the rest of the word Landing... In that case, when you''re staging your shot and getting your camera in position, try to notice the background elements that may detract, and reposition yourself so they''re no longer in frame.</td>', 'Only critique I would make is that from the right of the white pole over should be cropped out of the shot. They pull the viewer away from the skater... ah, but if you do that you lose the rest of the word Landing... In that case, when you''re staging your shot and getting your camera in position, try to notice the background elements that may detract, and reposition yourself so they''re no longer in frame.', '2008-11-02 10:06:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038474, 733795, 4493, '<td valign="top">I can''t connect with the girl on the bike. Without more of her surroundings, I feel you had a long lens on your camera and was out taking pictures of cute women. What is everyone else there doing? What''s the whole scene? Sometimes getting in close and personal works, other times, you need a sense of their surroundings so you can connect with them.</td>', 'I can''t connect with the girl on the bike. Without more of her surroundings, I feel you had a long lens on your camera and was out taking pictures of cute women. What is everyone else there doing? What''s the whole scene? Sometimes getting in close and personal works, other times, you need a sense of their surroundings so you can connect with them.', '2008-11-02 10:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038479, 732863, 4493, '<td valign="top">I don''t know where I am, or what I''m looking through, but the combination of grain, and b/w make a nice artistic shot.</td>', 'I don''t know where I am, or what I''m looking through, but the combination of grain, and b/w make a nice artistic shot.', '2008-11-02 10:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038491, 733171, 4493, '<td valign="top">Drew Carey and Diddy on the street? Fun little shot.</td>', 'Drew Carey and Diddy on the street? Fun little shot.', '2008-11-02 10:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038498, 733665, 4493, '<td valign="top">The lines and angles are nice. Try a b/w conversion to make it a study of the shapes... then the people are an added interest, not the main subject.</td>', 'The lines and angles are nice. Try a b/w conversion to make it a study of the shapes... then the people are an added interest, not the main subject.', '2008-11-02 10:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038547, 733094, 4493, '<td valign="top">Woman far right makes this a great shot. Her expression is priceless. I can feel the scene and energy. Great capture. 2nd 10 vote from me!</td>', 'Woman far right makes this a great shot. Her expression is priceless. I can feel the scene and energy. Great capture. 2nd 10 vote from me!', '2008-11-02 10:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038641, 733798, 32767, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of selective desat. Just an opinion but I think this would have worked naturally by letting the colors speak for themselves without manipulation. Myself as a viewer, I prefer not being lead.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of selective desat. Just an opinion but I think this would have worked naturally by letting the colors speak for themselves without manipulation. Myself as a viewer, I prefer not being lead.', '2008-11-02 11:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038649, 733340, 32767, '<td valign="top">The guy has reasonably interesting look but honestly the tone of the skin and lack of contrast makes the image look like it was resurrected from underexposure. I could be wrong but it''s making it hard to give this high marks.</td>', 'The guy has reasonably interesting look but honestly the tone of the skin and lack of contrast makes the image look like it was resurrected from underexposure. I could be wrong but it''s making it hard to give this high marks.', '2008-11-02 11:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038652, 733801, 32767, '<td valign="top">This one could ribbon. My personal taste... a bit too slick for a street photo but a really great image.</td>', 'This one could ribbon. My personal taste... a bit too slick for a street photo but a really great image.', '2008-11-02 11:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038693, 733402, 75532, '<td valign="top">this reminds me of another picture I saw here on DPC where a little girl was staring at a man on the floor, asking for money, and her mom was pushing her away, the little girl was the only one looking.  This picture has the exact same emotiont o it.  I wish the colors weren''t as bright and happy, maybe a little more subdued, but I love this picture. Adding it to my favorites 10</td>', 'this reminds me of another picture I saw here on DPC where a little girl was staring at a man on the floor, asking for money, and her mom was pushing her away, the little girl was the only one looking.  This picture has the exact same emotiont o it.  I wish the colors weren''t as bright and happy, maybe a little more subdued, but I love this picture. Adding it to my favorites 10', '2008-11-02 12:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038696, 733695, 47854, '<td valign="top">corridor photo is simple but the added colors are fantastic</td>', 'corridor photo is simple but the added colors are fantastic', '2008-11-02 12:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038698, 733821, 75532, '<td valign="top">in this single spot alone, imagine the photographic opportunities! The colors, the bend in the road, the people walking away (or towards you ie those apportunities!) They look a bit...dodged around them, not sure I like that 8</td>', 'in this single spot alone, imagine the photographic opportunities! The colors, the bend in the road, the people walking away (or towards you ie those apportunities!) They look a bit...dodged around them, not sure I like that 8', '2008-11-02 12:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038701, 733465, 47854, '<td valign="top">looks he got the photo by chance</td>', 'looks he got the photo by chance', '2008-11-02 12:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5038702, 733505, 75532, '<td valign="top">wow, what if something went wrong and they slid on the gras (looks like grass) and crashed into her? crazy! sure is a different kind of wedding photo</td>', 'wow, what if something went wrong and they slid on the gras (looks like grass) and crashed into her? crazy! sure is a different kind of wedding photo', '2008-11-02 12:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
