(5038709, 733363, 75532, '<td valign="top">I love this picture. A homeless taking in a homeless. Makes me want to cry. I work for the SPCA and we get guys that come in and say they found a cat, but they cant take care of it and want to keep it- we provide them with bags of free cat food, that they happily walk away with to show their new friends</td>', 'I love this picture. A homeless taking in a homeless. Makes me want to cry. I work for the SPCA and we get guys that come in and say they found a cat, but they cant take care of it and want to keep it- we provide them with bags of free cat food, that they happily walk away with to show their new friends', '2008-11-02 12:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
