(5039152, 732711, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get the significance of the sunglasses, except that they are all wearing them. I like the shot, however. They appear to be very actively pushing whatever cause they are supporting. I feel like this woman is giving me a handbill about the cause. (Whether I want to take it or not!) Could have done without the negative border though. It distracts me from the point of the image.</td>', 'I don''t quite get the significance of the sunglasses, except that they are all wearing them. I like the shot, however. They appear to be very actively pushing whatever cause they are supporting. I feel like this woman is giving me a handbill about the cause. (Whether I want to take it or not!) Could have done without the negative border though. It distracts me from the point of the image.', '2008-11-02 16:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
