(5039575, 733438, 75713, '<td valign="top">coming back to comment only:<br/> <br/>It looks like you shot her through glass from inside a building - and the pp makes her look like a mannequin which to me makes this photograph interesting - like the mannequin is outside in the "real world" and the real people are inside the store ... just my take on it.. fascintating shot - bumping up</td>', 'coming back to comment only: It looks like you shot her through glass from inside a building - and the pp makes her look like a mannequin which to me makes this photograph interesting - like the mannequin is outside in the "real world" and the real people are inside the store ... just my take on it.. fascintating shot - bumping up', '2008-11-02 21:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
