(5039629, 733379, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but a photo of another photographer implies "shooting buddy" and not street photography, as I understand the concept. As much as I like this photo, it would not be fair to others in the challenge to give it the high vote it otherwise should get. S''okay. My own entry is also getting some hits for my not understanding the concept.</td>', 'I like the shot, but a photo of another photographer implies "shooting buddy" and not street photography, as I understand the concept. As much as I like this photo, it would not be fair to others in the challenge to give it the high vote it otherwise should get. S''okay. My own entry is also getting some hits for my not understanding the concept.', '2008-11-02 21:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
