(5040138, 733775, 68504, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderfully understated shot. The outside silver and blues against the inside golden warmth. As for cropping, I cannot find anything that does not contribute to all the musings that this photo provokes.</td>', 'This is a wonderfully understated shot. The outside silver and blues against the inside golden warmth. As for cropping, I cannot find anything that does not contribute to all the musings that this photo provokes.', '2008-11-03 00:57:03.000000', NULL, 0),
