(5040325, 733486, 60195, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Red, Judi! This was one of 2 shots that I gave a last minute bump to a 9.  Best of Show.  Absolutely love the clarity, the subject, and the way the slight vignette on the lower half gives it a special depth.  Well done :O)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-11-03 04:08:12.</i></td>', 'Congrats on the Red, Judi! This was one of 2 shots that I gave a last minute bump to a 9.  Best of Show.  Absolutely love the clarity, the subject, and the way the slight vignette on the lower half gives it a special depth.  Well done :O)', '2008-11-03 04:06:27.000000', '2008-11-03 04:08:12.000000', 0),
